WEBVTT

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:11.750
Pirates!

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.540
Plunderrrr!

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.170
Yeah!

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.000
Hurry up! To the mountains!

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.630
Run! Hurry!

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.650
Stop!

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:31.450
Saga!

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:33.430
One Piece Movie
The Cursed Holy Sword

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.810
Seven Star Sword?

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:36.980
What's that?

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:41.940
A legendary sword that's said to be
the most beautiful sword on Grand Line!

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:47.990
And rumour has it, the spectacular treasure
is right here, on Aska Island!

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:53.990
- Yummy! Good, good.
- That was MY meat! Give it back!

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:55.870
Hey mister! More meat please!

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.370
More meat!

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:01.210
There's none left! You ate it all!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.880
It's no ordinary treasure!

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.960
Give me back my meat!

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:08.630
You guys have had enough.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.880
Give it back! Give it back! My meat!

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:13.550
We have to save some money to buy food
for Zoro and Usopp guarding the ship.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.640
It's the most precious treasure
on Grand Line!

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.470
The treasure's right here!

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:20.130
- Oh God...
- It's only a rumour, right?

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.560
I'm sure it's here. Well, probably...

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:24.230
Meat is better than treasure!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.320
I've done some research

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:28.740
- on the Seven Star Sword before.
- Hm?

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:34.620
Since the ancient times, the people on
this island have feared the Red Moon

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:38.500
that appears once every 100 years for it
brings disaster and anomaly.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:39.460
Red Moon?

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:42.120
So in order to protect the people of Aska,

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:45.420
the Gods of the Seven Stars of Aska

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.340
gave the King 3 gems as a shield against evil,

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:51.380
and the invincible Seven Star Sword
to fight evil.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:55.050
An invincible but beautiful sword
of the Gods!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.060
And gems too! Wow!

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:58.340
This is so exciting!

00:03:58.820 --> 00:03:59.930
But soon after,

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:02.100
an ironic twist in fate
awaited the Seven Star Sword.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.230
What?

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:06.690
There's a part of the legend
that seems prophetic.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.860
On the night of the full Red Moon,

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.620
a great power is bestowed onto the Sword.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:14.160
If its power overcomes
that of the Seven Stars,

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.730
the world will fall into an age of darkness...

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.620
An age of darkness...?

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:28.550
Sawing, sawing...

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:30.630
Fit it in.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.220
Nailing, nailing...

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.350
Hey, Zoro!

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:45.150
Hand me those planks, will you?

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.040
Come on, man!
At least say yes or no!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.170
You've been taking a nap the whole time...

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:09.250
So why don't...you...

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:10.710
help...

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.590
Hey, Zoro?!

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:14.930
Zoro!

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.040
You must be Roronoa Zoro.

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.750
We've been waiting for you.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.290
Thank you for coming.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:53.260
This way please.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:12.820
You're not getting away this time,
Straw Hat Pirates!

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.490
Fire! Fire! Fire away!

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:26.410
Where's Zoro?! Usopp!

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.870
I thought you guys were
guarding the ship together!

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.760
I told you,

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:36.630
he disappeared
while I was doing some repairs!

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:43.260
Geez, you guys are a pain!

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:44.470
We better do something. Hm?!

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.100
Over there!

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:49.440
Maybe he went out for a walk or something.

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:51.980
And ditched guarding the ship?

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.270
Zoro wouldn't do something like that!

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.780
There must be a reason.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.110
- A reason?
- Okay then!

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.740
Let's go look for Zoro!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.760
You guys!
We're gonna go between those islands!

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:09.920
I see!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.880
Nami, you don't get to give orders!
I choose where this ship's going!

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:17.510
But there's nothing else we can do
to outrun the marines!

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:19.090
We have to go look for Zoro!

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:20.430
- Go back!
- What?!

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.970
We can't do that now!!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.060
Oh no! They're in front of us too!

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:31.690
They're going to sandwich us!

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:33.900
We better listen to our navigator for now.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.230
Luffy, we'll go look for Zoro
after we get away, okay?!

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:41.160
- Okay!!
- Come on!

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:42.570
Don't let the Straw Hat escape!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.620
Go!! Don't lose them!

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:49.990
Yes sir!!

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:03.510
You're going down!

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:10.890
- We're gonna hit!
- This doesn't look good...!

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.940
- Keep going!
- What?!

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:14.610
- Everybody, hang on tight!
- Huh!?

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:16.690
- Hey hey!
- What are you gonna do?!

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.150
FLY!

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.200
Luffy!

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:26.950
- We're flying!
- You're kidding...

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:31.210
- What?!
- Captain, starboard!

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.580
You idiots!!

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:35.790
What are you doing?!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.960
Take that, marines!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:40.800
I hope we don't fall.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.180
Where are we gonna land, captain?!

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:45.340
I'm sure there's somewhere.

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:46.850
Get serious!

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:48.640
We're falling!

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:52.140
There's no water down there! Only rocks!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.820
We're still alive?!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.310
I guess so...

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:06.820
Phew...

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:10.620
Ouch...! What was that rock we landed on?

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:12.080
Where are we?

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:13.790
That was FUN!

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.070
No, it wasn't!!

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:43.650
Master, he's here.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.250
Saga.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.580
My life...

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:38.830
...is yours.

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:57.020
So this is the precious dagger
from your childhood!

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:00.520
And the sign of your friendship
with Master Saga. isn't it?

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:04.400
Talk about being where I shouldn't be.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.820
You know, I'm an enemy to the marines.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:10.160
Yeah. I was surprised to hear.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:13.620
Zoro the Pirate Hunter is now a pirate.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:18.990
For someone whose goal was
to master the “sword of justice“

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.870
ever since we were kids,
I must disgust you.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.420
Don't go back on that pirate ship.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:25.590
It's not that simple.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:28.090
I've got my reasons...

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:30.800
- Master!
- Don't touch me!

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:32.800
- Yes, sir.
- Saga?!

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:35.850
What's wrong?!

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:38.100
Zoro...

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.480
Will you do something for me?

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.400
You'll help me,

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:46.820
Won't you? Zoro!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.240
Let's hear it.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:53.530
- Yo! Zoroooo!
- Where are you?! Zoro!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:55.740
' Hey» Zoro!
- Hm?

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:58.370
- There's a big pond over there!
- What?

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:02.330
Wow...! What a beautiful lake!

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.040
Pirates!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.670
Look! There's someone there!

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:32.300
- Where? Where?
- Is it Zoro?

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.880
It's a girl!

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:37.180
And she's really, really cute!

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:40.010
Let's ask her if she's seen Zoro.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:43.730
Hey you!!

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:46.940
Have you seen a guy named Zoro
around here?

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:51.020
- Hey!!!
- Look over here!

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.650
Why is she running away?

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:56.030
That's what people usually do when they
see a pirate ship.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.280
Hey!

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:58.370
Don't! Luffy, NO!

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:00.080
Wait, hey!

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:01.290
Luffy! Usopp!

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.670
- Wait!!
- No, YOU stop, Luffy!

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.260
Where are you? Have you seen Zoro?

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:17.190
STOP, Luffy!

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:21.970
He's the guy with scary
eyes carrying 3 swords!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:26.980
- Where did those two go?!
- Cutie pie, where are you?

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:28.020
Over there!

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:29.400
I see her!

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:31.190
Wait! We just wanna ask you something!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.400
Don't be afraid!

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.170
We're not suspicious people!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.870
You're suspicious enough.

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:43.230
Oh, Nami-san, come on...!

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.750
What's your name?!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:54.300
Where did Luffy and Usopp go?

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:57.050
- Maybe they're lost.
- Wait for me!

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.430
So now, we're missing three.

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.050
Those trouble makers!

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.130
- Oh oh...
- We lost her.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:08.060
Where are you?!

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:09.650
- Look! There's a village.
- Where?

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:12.520
Oh yeah! Let's go there!

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.150
I see her!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.110
Please stop!

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:18.900
Granny!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:20.660
Everybody!

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:21.940
Pirates!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:27.500
Our Gods of the Seven Stars

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:31.330
Please hear our prayers.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:34.720
With your great love

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:37.800
Please protect us from evil.

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:42.220
Our Gods of the Seven Stars

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.260
- Everyone!
- Miss Maya?

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:47.520
Pirates! Pirates are coming!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.270
- What I?
- Not again!

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.630
It can't be!

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:53.900
Pirates, those rogues! At a time like this...

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:55.400
Come on, men! Get your weapons!

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.610
Let's go!

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:00.200
- Miss Maya, take care of your grandmother!
- I will!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.660
I didn't think they would come back!

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.490
- Oh no...
- Lady Baba!

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:06.080
Don't panic.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:09.000
Hide! And take the children!

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:10.280
Yes!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:15.170
Take this!

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:16.710
Hurry!

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:18.420
Over there!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.210
Over here too!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.420
Let's go!

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:22.800
Hide! Hurry!

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:25.550
The women protect the kids!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.150
You guys go to the east!

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:29.560
Got it!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:33.770
I will not let something horrible
like that ever happen again! Ever!

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:36.570
Granny, you have to hide!

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.070
No. I must protect this place.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:40.780
- But...
- Hello there.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:41.820
Pirates!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.280
- Miss Maya! Run!
- Huh?

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:47.910
Maya? Is that your name?
What a beautiful name!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.500
Hm? But which one?

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:53.080
You don't belong here!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:54.530
Leave us alone!

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:56.880
Excuse me? Why do you say that?

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.300
We' re uninvited guests.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:03.440
But I can tell this is no ordinary
village. Look at the weapons.

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:04.960
You have a point.

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:07.680
I think we'll find a lot of interesting
things here.

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:12.020
- Hm?
- We will not defer to pirates! Never!

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:14.020
That is so brave of you!

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:16.520
This doesn't look too good.

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:18.110
The deer talked!

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:20.820
I'm not a deer! I'm a reindeer!

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:26.410
- He's cute...!
- Don't call me cute!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:27.410
Come on.

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:29.660
Let's be peaceful about this.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.700
We're just looking for our friends.

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:36.170
We're not here to cause any trouble.

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:38.140
This is...

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:39.460
Hey Pirate!

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:41.630
Keep your filthy hands off of that!

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:42.880
What did you just say?

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:45.300
You better watch your words.

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:49.810
Aha!! You ARE planning something,
aren't you? You greedy pirates!

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.310
Oh my God!!

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:53.100
The swordsmen from
the marine corps dojo!

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:54.880
Damn!

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:56.940
Marines?!

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:57.860
What's going on?

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.150
Kill anyone who gets in the way!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.610
Show them that we're the boss!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.540
Stand strong!

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:13.620
Yeah!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.160
Don't let them through!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:16.960
You're all dead.

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:19.880
Criminals that disobey the marine corps!

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:27.470
Criminals?

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:30.350
Nami, are they bad people?

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.970
No! We're just...

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.520
What?

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.770
The ancestors' altar. . .!

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:45.810
What are you holding there?

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:49.740
Zoro! Over here!
What?!

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:51.990
Zoro?!

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.260
- Bastard!
- You Marine's tool!

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:08.750
He's good.

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:10.460
Zoro?!

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.680
What are you doing?!

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:14.430
Why are you with the marines?

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:15.920
Zoro!

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:18.350
Are those the gems?

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:21.060
- Gems?
- Maya...

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:23.900
We'll take care of this!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:27.780
Zoro!!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.240
Son of a bitch! What is he thinking?!

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:31.610
Sanji-kun!

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:41.460
- Granny!
- Stop right there.

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:45.050
Are you out of your mind, Zoro?

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.800
No, definitely not.

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:49.000
You're not, huh?

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:53.760
No man's gonna threaten a lady with a sword
and get away with it. Not even you!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:03.350
- Zoro and Sanji!
- What?

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:06.110
You guys, stop! Zoro! Sanji-kun!

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.910
You have to step in
a little harder than that.

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:13.740
Bastard!

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:16.030
Do you know what you're doing?!

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:17.580
Sanji...

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:19.540
One last piece of advice.

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:23.210
When you're fighting a
swordsman, keep your mind on the fight!

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:25.090
As soon as you lose concentration...

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:27.670
You might as well be dead already.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:29.880
Zoro, you...

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.360
- Sanjiiii!
- Sanji-kun!

00:20:38.940 --> 00:20:40.390
Sanji! Oh no...!

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:43.240
Why? Why did you do that, Zoro?!

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.900
Why would you hurt a FRIEND like this?!

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:49.490
Lady Baba! Miss Maya!

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:51.990
Maya, run!

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:54.820
You scum!!

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.580
- Zoro!!
- Miss Maya“

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:17.260
I'll take these.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:18.140
Give them back!

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.600
They're very special gems! We need those!

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:22.520
I do too.

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:23.690
Give up!

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:24.690
Draw your swords!

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:28.480
This island is under the control of
the marine corps dojo.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:33.650
You are all aware that you are not
supposed to conduct any rituals or

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.620
meetings without our permission.

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:38.090
In other words...

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:44.080
What you're doing now is
going against the marines. That's treason!

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:46.580
If you don't start listening to us,

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:48.840
we're gonna have to kill all of you.

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:52.260
Come on, Zoro!

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:56.720
Zoro, what happened to you?!

00:21:57.560 --> 00:21:59.510
Why is he doing this?!

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:00.720
Why, Nami?!

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:03.270
That's what I'd like to know too.

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:06.690
Are you all right, Lacos?

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:08.490
I'm so sorry, Miss Maya.

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:10.020
I couldn't help...

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:12.440
- Don't worry about it.
- But...

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.210
how can we now prevent
the resurrection of the Seven Star Sword?

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:17.490
Seven Star Sword?!

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:18.780
Resurrection?

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:20.330
I'm mortified!

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:25.250
Hey, Zoro!

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:41.600
Oh no, Luffy...

00:22:41.690 --> 00:22:44.100
This looks like the marine corps dojo!

00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:49.270
This is like digging our own graves!

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:52.570
Come on, let's get out of here!

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:54.860
Hey, have you seen Zoro?

00:22:55.160 --> 00:22:57.610
You know...Zoro. Watch it! Zoro!

00:22:57.710 --> 00:22:59.620
Zoroooo!

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:01.280
Don't!

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:02.490
Luffy the Straw Hat Pirate.

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:06.250
Hey, do you know a guy named Zoro?

00:23:06.340 --> 00:23:07.460
Mr Zoro?

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:09.290
He should be coming back soon.

00:23:09.390 --> 00:23:12.540
Oh really?!
Then we'll wait here for him.

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:14.090
Usopp, did you hear that?

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:15.420
Zoro's coming back.

00:23:15.520 --> 00:23:18.220
What is he doing at a marine corps dojo?

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:20.220
Who cares?

00:23:20.310 --> 00:23:22.720
As long as Zoro comes back! Right?!

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:34.680
It's hard to believe
you're worth 100 million berries.

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:36.240
Oh yeah. But I am.

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:38.280
You look like a swordsman.

00:23:38.370 --> 00:23:39.700
Not “look like.“

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:42.660
He's the master of this marine corps dojo.

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:45.370
Master Saga. Oh...okay, Saga.

00:23:46.550 --> 00:23:49.110
Look at that long sword!

00:23:49.220 --> 00:23:51.170
Is that what you use?! Wow!

00:23:52.510 --> 00:23:54.420
That's cool!

00:23:55.430 --> 00:23:57.630
You are funny, Mr Luffy.

00:23:57.730 --> 00:23:58.800
Why?

00:23:59.730 --> 00:24:02.970
Master, may I see if this is really the man

00:24:03.060 --> 00:24:08.560
who defeated Crocodile,
one of the leaders of the Seven Royal Seas?

00:24:08.650 --> 00:24:09.730
I'll allow it.

00:24:10.110 --> 00:24:11.230
What?

00:24:23.710 --> 00:24:24.740
Hey!

00:24:24.840 --> 00:24:26.580
If you wanna fight, just say so!

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:30.290
Wow...

00:24:30.380 --> 00:24:33.500
There aren't many people who can stave off
my “iai“ sword.

00:24:33.590 --> 00:24:35.340
I haven't felt this way in a long time!

00:24:35.930 --> 00:24:37.310
Playtime is over.

00:24:37.390 --> 00:24:38.420
What?!

00:24:38.850 --> 00:24:41.180
You won't be seeing Zoro.

00:24:41.270 --> 00:24:44.340
He has already cut ties with you loser pirates.

00:24:46.900 --> 00:24:49.140
And what makes you say that?

00:24:49.240 --> 00:24:50.640
Luffy!

00:24:50.740 --> 00:24:51.810
Tohma, stand back.

00:24:52.570 --> 00:24:53.600
Yes, sir.

00:25:00.250 --> 00:25:01.280
Wanna fight?

00:25:04.130 --> 00:25:06.280
Okay... Here we go!

00:25:06.590 --> 00:25:07.990
Gum-Gum

00:25:08.090 --> 00:25:09.160
Pistol!

00:25:10.880 --> 00:25:12.370
Gum-Gum

00:25:12.590 --> 00:25:14.000
Whip!

00:25:14.090 --> 00:25:15.170
- Oops.
- Whoa!

00:25:15.800 --> 00:25:16.880
Go, Luffy!

00:25:17.300 --> 00:25:19.380
Oh, sorry about that.

00:25:19.470 --> 00:25:21.260
I was just trying to get HIM.

00:25:25.600 --> 00:25:26.680
Are you ready?

00:25:27.770 --> 00:25:28.930
Come on!

00:25:41.500 --> 00:25:42.770
Ew, what's that?

00:25:42.870 --> 00:25:43.950
Spooky!

00:25:44.040 --> 00:25:46.280
That's a weird sword.

00:25:46.380 --> 00:25:47.830
You know what? I don't like you.

00:25:48.380 --> 00:25:50.700
You have no idea what this sword can do.

00:25:50.800 --> 00:25:52.960
Can you hear its voice?

00:25:55.220 --> 00:25:56.750
It craves your blood!

00:26:10.730 --> 00:26:11.770
No way!

00:26:12.230 --> 00:26:13.270
Fool.

00:26:15.030 --> 00:26:16.100
Jerk!

00:26:16.530 --> 00:26:17.560
Gum-Gum

00:26:17.660 --> 00:26:19.360
Stamp!

00:26:23.750 --> 00:26:24.860
Get 'im, Luffy!

00:26:24.960 --> 00:26:27.030
I didn't know Mr Luffy ate the devil's fruit.

00:26:27.120 --> 00:26:28.200
One more!

00:26:28.290 --> 00:26:30.280
Those are interesting moves.

00:26:30.380 --> 00:26:31.870
Interesting or whatever...

00:26:32.130 --> 00:26:35.830
He's squashed the toughest of the toughest
pirates with those moves!

00:26:36.300 --> 00:26:40.350
You should have seen all the trouble
I went through to teach him all those.

00:26:40.430 --> 00:26:41.590
Really?

00:26:41.720 --> 00:26:43.630
That means you must be really strong too!

00:26:43.720 --> 00:26:45.630
Yeah, well, you know...

00:26:52.530 --> 00:26:55.190
That sword really is spooky.

00:26:55.610 --> 00:26:58.060
And you're really 100 million berries?

00:26:58.160 --> 00:27:00.860
What a joke!
You're no different from any other pirate.

00:27:00.950 --> 00:27:02.110
Wrong!

00:27:02.200 --> 00:27:04.490
I'm the future Pirate King!

00:27:05.370 --> 00:27:06.490
Pirate King?!

00:27:06.580 --> 00:27:08.450
You tell 'em, Captain!

00:27:08.960 --> 00:27:09.990
Idiot.

00:27:10.080 --> 00:27:12.490
What good is it to pursue
such a futile dream?

00:27:12.590 --> 00:27:14.830
You might as well just throw your life away.

00:27:14.920 --> 00:27:16.410
Don't you realize that?

00:27:16.510 --> 00:27:18.290
It's something that I decided I was gonna do.

00:27:18.800 --> 00:27:19.960
Dream..

00:27:20.050 --> 00:27:21.240
You're pathetic.

00:27:21.550 --> 00:27:22.590
Fine then.

00:27:23.510 --> 00:27:27.090
If you're worthy of being the sacrifice
for this Seven Star Sword,

00:27:27.180 --> 00:27:29.220
I'll spare your life for a little while longer.

00:27:29.310 --> 00:27:30.390
If not...

00:27:31.400 --> 00:27:32.550
You die now.

00:27:32.650 --> 00:27:35.020
I'm sick of listening to you! Take this!

00:27:37.530 --> 00:27:39.020
Gum-Gum

00:27:39.110 --> 00:27:40.300
Spear!

00:27:45.950 --> 00:27:47.280
Gum-Gum

00:27:51.540 --> 00:27:52.700
Bastard!

00:27:58.420 --> 00:28:00.620
Ick, so spooky!

00:28:00.720 --> 00:28:02.580
He's really strong!!

00:28:05.010 --> 00:28:06.420
What? Are you quitting already?

00:28:15.730 --> 00:28:17.010
“Demon Fire“!!!

00:28:23.700 --> 00:28:24.820
Luffy!

00:28:31.830 --> 00:28:33.070
Luffy!

00:28:33.170 --> 00:28:34.360
Luffy!

00:28:34.960 --> 00:28:37.200
Luffy!

00:28:37.760 --> 00:28:39.130
Oh well.

00:28:39.220 --> 00:28:42.670
I thought he'd put up a better fight.

00:28:42.800 --> 00:28:44.070
I'm kind of disappointed.

00:28:44.760 --> 00:28:46.030
Right, Mr Usopp?

00:28:46.760 --> 00:28:49.430
I'm the proud warrior of
the high seas, the great Usopp!

00:28:50.020 --> 00:28:51.590
I won't let my friend down!

00:28:52.560 --> 00:28:54.140
Ever!

00:28:54.230 --> 00:28:56.220
He jumped!

00:29:00.110 --> 00:29:04.190
Is this finally the end of my glorious life...?

00:29:04.700 --> 00:29:05.730
Hey, I know!

00:29:05.830 --> 00:29:08.690
A new device I made for a time like this...

00:29:08.950 --> 00:29:11.950
Usopp Skyrider!!

00:29:12.620 --> 00:29:13.860
It worked!!

00:29:14.630 --> 00:29:16.530
<i>It's too small!!</i>

00:29:16.630 --> 00:29:18.620
So this is it after all?!

00:29:18.710 --> 00:29:20.950
Whhhhyyy?!

00:29:40.150 --> 00:29:41.180
How's the wound?

00:29:41.280 --> 00:29:42.350
- Great.
- I'm doing OK.

00:29:44.780 --> 00:29:47.530
Hey doctor, we need more medicine.

00:29:47.870 --> 00:29:49.360
Coming right up!

00:29:49.450 --> 00:29:53.570
Maya's granny and these kids
gathered a lot of herbs for me!

00:29:54.750 --> 00:29:56.530
We'll go find more!

00:29:58.960 --> 00:30:00.450
Easy, easy...

00:30:01.510 --> 00:30:03.830
Don't be a sissy, big man!

00:30:05.380 --> 00:30:08.460
Chopper really IS a doctor.

00:30:08.680 --> 00:30:11.130
And I assure you he's a good one!

00:30:12.220 --> 00:30:13.800
Hey...you can flatter me all you want...

00:30:13.890 --> 00:30:16.140
Not that it's not gonna
make me happy or anything...

00:30:16.230 --> 00:30:17.930
Go away!

00:30:22.320 --> 00:30:23.390
Sanji-kun,

00:30:23.490 --> 00:30:25.850
you don't have to do that. You're hurt.

00:30:25.950 --> 00:30:27.060
Yeah.

00:30:27.820 --> 00:30:29.570
I'm a chef.

00:30:30.870 --> 00:30:33.940
It keeps my mind off the pain.

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:36.820
That son of a bitch Zoro...

00:30:37.250 --> 00:30:40.450
He stole something
that was very precious to Maya.

00:30:40.960 --> 00:30:42.040
I'm so sorry.

00:30:43.130 --> 00:30:45.040
They were very special to you,

00:30:45.130 --> 00:30:46.510
weren't they?

00:30:49.680 --> 00:30:51.880
Miss Maya, I can do the rest.

00:30:51.970 --> 00:30:53.210
All right.

00:30:53.310 --> 00:30:55.090
I don't believe him! That Zoro!

00:30:56.190 --> 00:30:57.220
By the way.

00:30:57.310 --> 00:30:59.760
- Where are our captain and Usopp?
- Oh yeah...!

00:31:00.770 --> 00:31:01.850
Those bastards.

00:31:02.190 --> 00:31:04.940
They're probably just
wandering around somewhere!

00:31:07.150 --> 00:31:08.730
Robin...

00:31:08.820 --> 00:31:11.860
It seemed like Maya's grandma
knew something about the Seven Star Sword.

00:31:11.990 --> 00:31:13.030
- Right.
- How's the wound?

00:31:13.160 --> 00:31:16.740
And the marines were saying something
about a ritual. I wonder what it is?

00:31:17.000 --> 00:31:18.030
Yeah.

00:31:18.120 --> 00:31:20.790
Here, have some stamina soup.

00:31:21.040 --> 00:31:23.370
It's good for your wound.

00:31:24.760 --> 00:31:25.790
Here.

00:31:28.930 --> 00:31:31.250
I think we were mistaken about you.

00:31:31.350 --> 00:31:32.530
I'm sorry.

00:31:33.010 --> 00:31:34.290
Don't worry about it.

00:31:34.390 --> 00:31:36.130
We're pirates.

00:31:36.230 --> 00:31:38.470
We're used to people coming after our lives.

00:31:39.900 --> 00:31:42.600
Granny, they really ARE pirates,

00:31:42.690 --> 00:31:44.100
but they're not bad people.

00:31:44.190 --> 00:31:46.060
Aw, come on!

00:31:46.150 --> 00:31:47.420
We're just being normal...

00:31:47.530 --> 00:31:48.770
Oh, Chopper, you!

00:31:48.860 --> 00:31:50.690
I'm saying this for your own good.

00:31:50.780 --> 00:31:53.610
- Leave the island immediately.
- What?

00:31:54.540 --> 00:31:55.810
Even pirates...

00:31:56.290 --> 00:31:58.960
don't want to lose their lives.

00:32:06.960 --> 00:32:08.240
I'm alive!

00:32:08.340 --> 00:32:09.500
YES!

00:32:09.590 --> 00:32:11.290
I'm an immortal warrior!

00:32:11.390 --> 00:32:13.670
The best luck that gets me through the worst!

00:32:13.760 --> 00:32:18.760
An eternal superhero!
Warrior of the seas, the Great Usopp I am!

00:32:19.350 --> 00:32:20.540
Luffy?

00:32:20.640 --> 00:32:21.760
Luffy!

00:32:21.850 --> 00:32:23.470
Are you there, Luffy?!

00:32:29.400 --> 00:32:31.100
He must be nearby...

00:32:47.210 --> 00:32:48.250
In here?

00:32:48.340 --> 00:32:49.160
Yes.

00:32:59.600 --> 00:33:01.300
Thanks, Zoro.

00:33:01.390 --> 00:33:02.550
I appreciate it.

00:33:02.650 --> 00:33:05.510
Anybody could have gotten them for you.

00:33:06.230 --> 00:33:07.350
No,

00:33:08.110 --> 00:33:10.780
it had to be you.

00:33:12.910 --> 00:33:14.150
Master!

00:33:14.240 --> 00:33:15.270
Saga?!

00:33:16.620 --> 00:33:19.740
You said those balls are haunting you!

00:33:19.870 --> 00:33:21.360
I thought you'd get better when those
balls are gone...

00:33:21.460 --> 00:33:22.950
That's right!

00:33:23.040 --> 00:33:25.710
I'm not in pain right now...

00:33:26.710 --> 00:33:29.280
I'm just shaking with joy...

00:33:29.800 --> 00:33:31.620
You'll see.

00:33:36.050 --> 00:33:39.550
Roronoa Zoro, you're one of us now.

00:33:40.930 --> 00:33:44.260
I watched the rumoured
3 sword fighting style.

00:33:44.350 --> 00:33:46.890
I hope to practise with you one of these days.

00:33:46.980 --> 00:33:50.810
That'd be great!
I wanna practise with Mr Zoro too!

00:33:51.190 --> 00:33:52.350
Oh, by the way...

00:33:52.780 --> 00:33:55.600
Master knocked off Mr Luffy
the Straw Hat Pirate.

00:33:55.700 --> 00:33:58.610
But he's no concern of yours anymore, is he?

00:34:02.250 --> 00:34:04.150
What is this place?

00:34:04.250 --> 00:34:06.160
It's so eerie in here.

00:34:06.880 --> 00:34:08.450
Another hole here?

00:34:10.550 --> 00:34:12.080
And here too?

00:34:14.260 --> 00:34:16.820
Oh boy... There're holes everywhere!

00:34:16.970 --> 00:34:18.350
Damn it.

00:34:18.430 --> 00:34:21.760
LUFFY!!!

00:34:21.850 --> 00:34:24.090
Can you hear me?!

00:34:24.890 --> 00:34:26.340
Hey!

00:34:26.480 --> 00:34:29.810
Where are you?!

00:34:29.980 --> 00:34:33.310
LUFFYYY!

00:34:41.990 --> 00:34:43.780
Luffy!

00:34:44.460 --> 00:34:45.490
Oh, thank god.

00:34:45.580 --> 00:34:47.280
Hey, Usopp!

00:34:47.380 --> 00:34:49.830
Didn't you hear me call you?!

00:34:50.340 --> 00:34:52.120
Thanks, Usopp!

00:34:53.960 --> 00:34:55.910
What's so funny?

00:34:56.010 --> 00:34:57.750
I pulled this rope and...

00:34:57.840 --> 00:34:59.880
- Look what happened!
- Huh?!

00:35:04.810 --> 00:35:06.190
What is THAT?!

00:35:06.310 --> 00:35:08.550
See?! It's gonna be fun in here!

00:35:10.400 --> 00:35:14.770
Stop laughing and do something!

00:35:15.530 --> 00:35:16.640
Gum-Gum

00:35:16.740 --> 00:35:17.810
Pistol!

00:35:21.120 --> 00:35:22.940
- Phew...
- But I was having fun...

00:35:23.200 --> 00:35:26.320
You know how worried I was about you?!

00:35:26.790 --> 00:35:28.410
I'm so glad you're alive.

00:35:28.870 --> 00:35:31.240
It's gonna take more than that to kill me.

00:35:32.000 --> 00:35:33.540
Luffy...

00:35:34.460 --> 00:35:36.040
You had me worried there.

00:35:36.130 --> 00:35:38.000
Anyway, we have to get out of here.

00:35:38.090 --> 00:35:39.330
Which way should we go?

00:35:39.430 --> 00:35:40.800
This way, for sure.

00:35:40.890 --> 00:35:41.920
All right.

00:35:44.470 --> 00:35:46.630
Which way do we go?

00:35:46.730 --> 00:35:47.800
This way!

00:35:47.890 --> 00:35:49.270
Really?

00:35:53.610 --> 00:35:55.180
Look! Another rope!

00:35:55.480 --> 00:35:56.980
Don't!!!

00:35:57.570 --> 00:35:58.690
It broke.

00:35:58.780 --> 00:36:00.730
I thought it was another trap...

00:36:03.740 --> 00:36:05.530
It WAS a trap!

00:36:05.620 --> 00:36:07.740
An adventure inside the cave!

00:36:08.540 --> 00:36:09.780
Watch out! Watch out!

00:36:35.610 --> 00:36:37.470
Three princes...

00:36:37.570 --> 00:36:39.140
Priestess and the moon...

00:36:39.490 --> 00:36:41.650
And prayer.

00:36:58.590 --> 00:37:01.340
What should I do...?

00:37:01.680 --> 00:37:03.000
Forgive me...

00:37:04.300 --> 00:37:05.750
Saga...

00:37:18.900 --> 00:37:20.280
This is fun!

00:37:20.360 --> 00:37:22.060
This is NOT fun!

00:37:22.150 --> 00:37:23.230
What's that?

00:37:25.620 --> 00:37:26.810
There's some written on it.

00:37:26.910 --> 00:37:29.150
Hm?

00:37:29.250 --> 00:37:31.070
Hey, Usopp, look!

00:37:31.370 --> 00:37:32.490
It's the way out!

00:37:32.580 --> 00:37:34.490
Yay!

00:37:35.380 --> 00:37:37.080
We got out! Huh?!

00:37:38.420 --> 00:37:40.660
What's that weird tower?

00:37:41.760 --> 00:37:43.170
We did get out but...

00:37:43.510 --> 00:37:45.460
Where are we?

00:37:45.550 --> 00:37:48.170
We have to get back to the others.

00:37:48.260 --> 00:37:50.750
Maybe we should have gone the other way.

00:37:50.850 --> 00:37:52.590
Maybe. Let's go back!

00:37:52.690 --> 00:37:53.840
Yeah!

00:37:56.560 --> 00:37:58.850
Wait up, Luffy!

00:38:02.360 --> 00:38:03.850
Luffy!

00:38:14.670 --> 00:38:16.410
Oh!

00:38:16.500 --> 00:38:17.660
Here it is!

00:38:19.130 --> 00:38:20.620
We're out!

00:38:22.470 --> 00:38:24.160
Another weird tower...

00:38:24.260 --> 00:38:25.330
Nami!!

00:38:25.430 --> 00:38:26.750
Sanji!!

00:38:26.840 --> 00:38:29.600
Where are you guys?!

00:38:30.310 --> 00:38:32.550
I guess we'll have to go back again.

00:38:39.320 --> 00:38:40.470
Ow, ow, ow... Not my nose!

00:38:49.700 --> 00:38:50.730
Look, another one!

00:38:54.370 --> 00:38:56.450
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:38:56.750 --> 00:38:57.780
Over there!

00:39:00.800 --> 00:39:02.490
Another one, Usopp.

00:39:02.590 --> 00:39:03.780
This is the third tower.

00:39:04.420 --> 00:39:07.750
Not again.
Why do we keep finding these things?

00:39:08.300 --> 00:39:10.500
I'm hungry-

00:39:13.350 --> 00:39:15.670
Me too...

00:39:51.050 --> 00:39:52.170
Soon,

00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:54.250
it is the moment we've been waiting for!

00:39:54.850 --> 00:39:58.890
When the time comes,
I will give you all invincible power.

00:39:59.230 --> 00:40:01.430
The good and evil of this world
are judged...

00:40:01.520 --> 00:40:05.140
Not by law or order, or by the gods!

00:40:05.690 --> 00:40:06.930
It is by power!

00:40:07.030 --> 00:40:08.100
Power!

00:40:08.200 --> 00:40:10.440
Only those with power are
all-knowing and divine

00:40:10.530 --> 00:40:12.060
with the right to dominate this world!

00:40:12.740 --> 00:40:15.030
THAT is true justice!

00:40:16.200 --> 00:40:17.690
My swordsmen...

00:40:23.250 --> 00:40:25.370
With the Seven Star Sword...

00:40:25.550 --> 00:40:27.040
We will see true justice!

00:40:28.220 --> 00:40:30.920
And create a brand new world!

00:40:31.140 --> 00:40:32.460
With our power!

00:40:46.280 --> 00:40:49.140
To make my dream come true, Zoro...

00:40:49.990 --> 00:40:51.360
I needed you.

00:40:51.450 --> 00:40:52.520
Your dream?

00:40:52.620 --> 00:40:53.800
That's right.

00:40:53.910 --> 00:40:57.990
On the night of the Red Moon,
my dream becomes real.

00:41:19.890 --> 00:41:21.080
Does it still hurt?

00:41:21.190 --> 00:41:23.050
No. I'm totally fine!

00:41:23.150 --> 00:41:24.470
See?!

00:41:26.320 --> 00:41:28.520
Leave the island as soon as
you're done your meal.

00:41:28.940 --> 00:41:30.680
As I warned you yesterday.

00:41:31.200 --> 00:41:34.900
We can't leave without
Luffy and the others. Right?

00:41:34.990 --> 00:41:36.060
That's true.

00:41:36.160 --> 00:41:39.740
Those two are probably lost
somewhere on the island. I'm sure of it!

00:41:39.830 --> 00:41:42.070
Yelling “adventure!“ or something like that.

00:41:42.160 --> 00:41:44.870
Then as soon as your friends come back..

00:41:44.960 --> 00:41:47.520
Why do you want us to leave so bad?

00:41:47.630 --> 00:41:49.700
You still don't trust us?
Because we're pirates?

00:41:50.050 --> 00:41:51.240
No!

00:41:51.340 --> 00:41:53.580
We're saying this for your own sake!

00:41:53.680 --> 00:41:56.670
You mean, our lives will be in danger..

00:41:56.760 --> 00:41:57.800
You came to this island,

00:41:57.890 --> 00:42:01.170
because you heard the rumours
about the Seven Star Sword, didn't you?

00:42:01.310 --> 00:42:04.090
Yes! Nami loves rare treasure!

00:42:04.190 --> 00:42:07.140
Chopper! Keep your mouth shut!

00:42:08.230 --> 00:42:09.850
I thought so.

00:42:09.940 --> 00:42:14.190
The Seven Star Sword
isn't the kind of treasure you think it is.

00:42:14.320 --> 00:42:17.190
Robin was saying something like that.

00:42:19.080 --> 00:42:22.280
...The tragedy began on
the night of the Red Moon...

00:42:23.210 --> 00:42:24.740
That ominous night...

00:42:24.830 --> 00:42:27.590
The three princes of the kingdom of Aska...

00:42:28.630 --> 00:42:31.450
...met a beautiful priestess...

00:42:31.550 --> 00:42:33.620
...and they all fell in love with her.

00:42:34.880 --> 00:42:36.790
To win the young priestess's love...

00:42:36.890 --> 00:42:40.550
...the princes fought over
the Seven Star Sword,

00:42:41.060 --> 00:42:42.330
the symbol of the royal family.

00:42:47.100 --> 00:42:50.310
Bitter battles were fought among brothers,

00:42:50.400 --> 00:42:54.850
and the victims' despair and blood
permeated the land and the seas...

00:43:00.950 --> 00:43:05.110
And so the Seven Star Sword,
soaked in blood and hatred,

00:43:05.250 --> 00:43:07.280
seeks bloodshed and destruction.

00:43:07.670 --> 00:43:10.340
A curse of a demonic power,

00:43:10.420 --> 00:43:12.490
the sword led the kingdom of Aska
to destruction.

00:43:12.590 --> 00:43:13.860
Curse of a demonic power?

00:43:14.090 --> 00:43:16.570
I'm surprised you're able to read these.

00:43:16.680 --> 00:43:20.620
Robin is an archaeologist!
She's really smart!

00:43:20.720 --> 00:43:22.590
But I don't know the rest.

00:43:23.680 --> 00:43:26.220
It must have been a long time since the
stone deteriorated here.

00:43:26.690 --> 00:43:28.590
I will finish the story.

00:43:30.900 --> 00:43:32.170
Granny...

00:43:33.360 --> 00:43:34.770
Right this way, madam.

00:43:34.990 --> 00:43:37.020
With great demonic power,
the Seven Star Sword

00:43:37.490 --> 00:43:40.560
caused more bloody battles,

00:43:40.660 --> 00:43:42.980
and the carnage spread even onto the seas...

00:43:43.120 --> 00:43:48.070
And our beautiful ocean turned into
a world of darkness.

00:43:48.960 --> 00:43:50.230
And then...

00:43:55.420 --> 00:43:58.120
In order to stop the bloodshed...

00:43:58.220 --> 00:44:01.340
to rid the hatred,

00:44:01.930 --> 00:44:04.490
the priestess sacrificed her own life.

00:44:16.440 --> 00:44:19.900
The three princes vowed to atone for the
death of their beloved priestess,

00:44:19.990 --> 00:44:25.070
and sealed the power of the evil sword
with the three holy gems

00:44:25.160 --> 00:44:28.150
bestowed onto them by
the Gods of the Aska Seven Stars.

00:44:42.350 --> 00:44:43.880
But once every 100 years,

00:44:43.970 --> 00:44:45.920
on a night of the Red Moon,

00:44:46.020 --> 00:44:48.920
the sword generates great demonic power

00:44:49.020 --> 00:44:50.550
in order to resurrect itself.

00:44:50.770 --> 00:44:52.220
Demonic power?

00:44:52.310 --> 00:44:57.520
With the holy gems Maya purified,
we were going conduct a ritual

00:44:57.610 --> 00:45:01.660
to create a shield over the island
by placing the gems on top of the 3 towers.

00:45:01.740 --> 00:45:03.270
When's the night of the Red Moon?

00:45:03.370 --> 00:45:04.860
- Tonight.
- What?!

00:45:05.580 --> 00:45:09.240
So that's why the marines came.
To stop the ritual.

00:45:09.830 --> 00:45:13.240
Saga, their leader, now has the
Seven Star Sword.

00:45:13.670 --> 00:45:14.990
The evil sword?

00:45:15.090 --> 00:45:17.570
He wants to resurrect the evil sword,

00:45:17.670 --> 00:45:19.830
so the ritual was going to get in his way.

00:45:19.920 --> 00:45:22.680
He wanted nothing more than to get
rid of the 3 holy gems.

00:45:23.340 --> 00:45:26.920
But one who has been tainted with the
evil power of the sword

00:45:27.010 --> 00:45:28.260
cannot touch the gems.

00:45:28.890 --> 00:45:32.550
So that's why he used your friend to do it.

00:45:32.650 --> 00:45:33.720
Wait a minute!

00:45:33.810 --> 00:45:34.970
Who is this Saga?

00:45:35.060 --> 00:45:37.140
Zoro did all that for HIM?

00:45:37.230 --> 00:45:39.560
That can't be! No way!

00:45:39.650 --> 00:45:43.900
Saga and Zoro are childhood friends.
They used to practice in the same dojo.

00:45:43.990 --> 00:45:45.110
What?

00:45:45.200 --> 00:45:51.610
When he still lived in this village,
he told me about him.

00:45:51.710 --> 00:45:54.110
And about a promise they made.

00:45:54.210 --> 00:45:55.240
A promise?

00:46:00.970 --> 00:46:03.080
You're Zoro the Pirate Hunter!

00:46:03.180 --> 00:46:07.090
I heard you're the strongest pirate
in these seas.

00:46:07.760 --> 00:46:09.960
I guess it was just a stupid rumour.

00:46:10.430 --> 00:46:12.420
We're not finished yet!

00:46:13.270 --> 00:46:16.140
Those guns aren't going to work
on a man like him.

00:46:16.440 --> 00:46:17.890
What?! Who the heck are you?!

00:46:23.320 --> 00:46:25.560
- Long time no see.
- Saga, is that you?

00:46:26.410 --> 00:46:29.940
I also started a journey
to work on my skills as a swordsman.

00:46:31.290 --> 00:46:33.900
I knew we'd run into each other again, Zoro.

00:46:34.000 --> 00:46:35.190
You still have it.

00:46:35.960 --> 00:46:36.990
Of course.

00:46:37.540 --> 00:46:39.740
It's the dagger you gave me for our promise.

00:46:41.260 --> 00:46:42.410
You haven't forgotten, have you?

00:46:42.970 --> 00:46:46.910
We made a promise
on the morning you left the dojo!

00:46:47.510 --> 00:46:50.130
You're going to become
the world's greatest swordsman,

00:46:50.220 --> 00:46:52.300
and I'm going to master
the “sword of justice“!

00:46:53.600 --> 00:46:54.930
How can I forget?

00:46:57.860 --> 00:46:59.100
You joker!

00:47:02.570 --> 00:47:03.640
Get 'em!!

00:47:03.740 --> 00:47:05.060
Kill them all!

00:47:07.820 --> 00:47:09.310
What morons!

00:47:09.410 --> 00:47:11.400
Who do you think is on this ship?!

00:47:34.980 --> 00:47:36.050
Saga!

00:47:42.730 --> 00:47:44.110
The gunpowder!

00:47:45.030 --> 00:47:46.190
- Saga!
- Zoro!

00:47:46.280 --> 00:47:48.060
- I'll take care of it!
- You can't!!

00:47:50.780 --> 00:47:51.940
Damn...!

00:47:52.410 --> 00:47:55.490
Zoro,
there was an axe in the captain's room!

00:47:55.580 --> 00:47:56.610
Go get it!

00:47:56.710 --> 00:47:57.950
We need that axe!

00:47:58.040 --> 00:48:00.070
No! I'm not gonna leave you here!

00:48:00.500 --> 00:48:02.490
I'll be fine!

00:48:02.590 --> 00:48:03.910
Hurry up and go, Zoro!

00:48:04.010 --> 00:48:06.080
- I'll be right back! Hold on!
- Yeah!

00:48:06.630 --> 00:48:09.080
I'm gonna come back and
get you out, I promise.

00:48:09.760 --> 00:48:12.090
Don't screw it up, Zoro!

00:48:15.180 --> 00:48:16.220
Saga!

00:48:18.140 --> 00:48:20.140
SAGA!

00:48:22.360 --> 00:48:26.400
Saga miraculously survived the explosion,

00:48:26.490 --> 00:48:29.270
but lost the use of his right arm.

00:48:30.030 --> 00:48:33.690
He was lost and depressed
when he arrived on this island.

00:48:33.830 --> 00:48:36.360
He saved Zoro's life.

00:48:36.500 --> 00:48:37.570
Promise, huh...

00:48:37.660 --> 00:48:39.740
According to that story,

00:48:39.830 --> 00:48:41.820
it doesn't seem like Saga is a bad man.

00:48:41.920 --> 00:48:44.240
When he first came here,

00:48:44.340 --> 00:48:46.700
he was dejected
and wouldn't come out of his shell.

00:48:46.800 --> 00:48:47.870
But...

00:48:47.970 --> 00:48:51.040
With Miss Maya's kindness
and encouragement,

00:48:51.140 --> 00:48:52.790
he started to open up.

00:48:53.220 --> 00:48:55.210
There seemed to be hope.

00:48:55.310 --> 00:48:57.340
I thought they would get married...

00:48:57.430 --> 00:49:00.430
- ...and settle down in this village.
- What?

00:49:01.440 --> 00:49:03.920
Maya, you and Saga were...

00:49:07.320 --> 00:49:09.520
Then a year ago...

00:49:09.610 --> 00:49:13.270
Our peaceful island was attacked by pirates.

00:49:13.370 --> 00:49:17.110
Saga and us men tried to drive them away.

00:49:17.200 --> 00:49:23.620
That's when Saga took the cursed sword
in his hand and fell under its curse.

00:49:27.460 --> 00:49:28.700
Maya...

00:49:37.390 --> 00:49:38.550
Maya...

00:49:42.020 --> 00:49:44.640
If only... I had more power...

00:49:46.570 --> 00:49:47.750
Maya...

00:49:48.900 --> 00:49:50.770
Don't touch that!

00:49:50.860 --> 00:49:52.050
I could save you...

00:49:52.150 --> 00:49:53.230
Saga, don't!

00:49:53.700 --> 00:49:54.770
Saga!

00:49:55.780 --> 00:49:58.570
NO!

00:50:06.960 --> 00:50:08.040
Saga..

00:50:13.930 --> 00:50:15.000
Why...?!

00:50:18.680 --> 00:50:20.210
Why...?!

00:50:21.680 --> 00:50:22.760
Saga...

00:50:36.120 --> 00:50:37.770
l see...

00:50:38.370 --> 00:50:40.030
He was trying to save Maya...

00:50:40.120 --> 00:50:41.860
That's why he took the sword.

00:50:41.950 --> 00:50:45.070
If only I could have protected Miss Maya!

00:50:45.750 --> 00:50:46.910
Say no more.

00:50:47.210 --> 00:50:49.120
No one is to blame.

00:50:49.210 --> 00:50:50.790
No one...

00:50:50.880 --> 00:50:52.120
Since that day,

00:50:52.210 --> 00:50:54.080
Saga fell under the curse of the evil sword.

00:50:54.630 --> 00:50:57.330
He's not the Saga we know any more.

00:50:58.390 --> 00:50:59.630
Then Saga...

00:50:59.720 --> 00:51:01.880
No, the Seven Star Sword

00:51:01.970 --> 00:51:05.510
started controlling the minds of
the marine corps swordsmen,

00:51:05.600 --> 00:51:08.270
and hungry for bloodshed,
now it wants to recreate a world of darkness.

00:51:08.360 --> 00:51:09.390
What?!

00:51:10.020 --> 00:51:12.720
A world of darkness of bitter fighting
and bloodshed.

00:51:12.820 --> 00:51:15.570
Everything will be destroyed.

00:51:17.030 --> 00:51:18.110
Oh, man...

00:51:18.200 --> 00:51:20.570
We've been here since yesterday...

00:51:20.660 --> 00:51:23.530
When can we get out of here...?!

00:51:24.500 --> 00:51:25.530
This way!

00:51:25.620 --> 00:51:27.280
I know it! Let's go!

00:51:27.460 --> 00:51:28.910
- Luffy, wait!
- What?

00:51:29.460 --> 00:51:33.290
If I leave things up to you, we're gonna
need more lives than we already have.

00:51:33.380 --> 00:51:34.540
This way!

00:51:34.630 --> 00:51:36.670
No, not this way!

00:51:36.760 --> 00:51:39.000
This is fun!

00:51:45.940 --> 00:51:47.510
I can't stand this anymore!
I can't move!

00:51:47.600 --> 00:51:49.930
- Why are these things happening to me?
- Why?

00:51:50.020 --> 00:51:51.680
- It's all Zoro's fault!
- This is fun! But I'm still hungry...

00:51:51.770 --> 00:51:53.930
If only he hadn't gone off by himself!

00:51:55.110 --> 00:51:56.190
Water?

00:51:57.240 --> 00:51:58.940
Hey, water!

00:51:59.950 --> 00:52:01.480
What are these?

00:52:03.660 --> 00:52:05.150
Hey Usopp!

00:52:05.250 --> 00:52:06.320
Look at these weird...

00:52:09.540 --> 00:52:11.120
Did you find water?!

00:52:21.390 --> 00:52:22.340
Granny,

00:52:22.470 --> 00:52:25.420
isn't there a way to stop
the resurrection of the Seven Star Sword?

00:52:25.520 --> 00:52:30.550
We can't conduct the ritual
without the 3 gems they took.

00:52:31.270 --> 00:52:32.540
The ones Zoro took.

00:52:32.650 --> 00:52:36.020
So what? There's NOTHING we can do?!

00:52:37.070 --> 00:52:39.140
There IS a way.

00:52:39.240 --> 00:52:40.810
- Maya!
- What is it?

00:52:41.320 --> 00:52:45.030
The priestess in the legend is my ancestor.

00:52:45.120 --> 00:52:47.280
If I also sacrifice my life like she did...

00:52:47.960 --> 00:52:48.990
Miss Maya!

00:52:49.080 --> 00:52:50.410
You have to die?!

00:52:50.500 --> 00:52:51.530
What are you saying?!

00:52:51.630 --> 00:52:53.080
It's just a legend, right?

00:52:53.170 --> 00:52:54.620
An old fairytale!

00:52:54.710 --> 00:52:56.790
I don't believe it. It's a stupid story.

00:52:57.010 --> 00:53:00.250
But the Seven Star Sword actually exists!

00:53:00.340 --> 00:53:03.790
So what?! Are you okay
if your granddaughter dies

00:53:04.060 --> 00:53:06.170
for a story you don't even know is true?

00:53:06.270 --> 00:53:07.920
Of course I'm not okay with it!

00:53:11.650 --> 00:53:12.680
I'm sorry.

00:53:12.770 --> 00:53:13.930
That was uncalled for.

00:53:14.020 --> 00:53:15.180
That's all right.

00:53:15.270 --> 00:53:17.720
I appreciate your concern.

00:53:19.740 --> 00:53:22.220
This is our fate.

00:53:22.320 --> 00:53:23.480
Fate?

00:53:23.570 --> 00:53:27.320
The women in our family
have all been priestesses...

00:53:27.410 --> 00:53:31.270
...but as far as I know, no one has had
a power as strong as Maya's.

00:53:31.370 --> 00:53:32.610
Power?

00:53:32.710 --> 00:53:34.320
Power of prayer.

00:53:34.420 --> 00:53:35.490
Prayer...

00:53:35.590 --> 00:53:37.790
Now that we don't have the gems,

00:53:37.880 --> 00:53:43.750
we have to rely on Maya's power
to stop the resurrection of the sword.

00:53:43.840 --> 00:53:46.710
THIS is our fate.

00:53:46.850 --> 00:53:48.590
I'm sorry...

00:53:50.350 --> 00:53:51.540
I understand.

00:53:52.270 --> 00:53:53.650
Miss Maya...

00:53:54.060 --> 00:53:55.510
isn't there anything else we can do?

00:53:55.610 --> 00:53:59.220
Isn't there another way?!

00:54:00.740 --> 00:54:01.770
What's that noise?

00:54:01.860 --> 00:54:03.270
Is it...

00:54:03.360 --> 00:54:05.020
A sign of the sword's resurrection?!

00:54:05.200 --> 00:54:06.230
What?!

00:54:06.330 --> 00:54:08.480
It's too early for the moon.

00:54:13.000 --> 00:54:14.320
Luffy! You!

00:54:16.750 --> 00:54:17.990
- Luffy!
- Usopp!

00:54:20.050 --> 00:54:21.080
What?!

00:54:23.510 --> 00:54:24.540
Let's go!

00:54:26.010 --> 00:54:27.710
What are you guys doing?

00:54:27.810 --> 00:54:29.130
Hey you guys!

00:54:29.220 --> 00:54:30.760
We were so worried!

00:54:30.850 --> 00:54:31.880
Sorry, sorry.

00:54:32.310 --> 00:54:34.300
Thank God we found you!

00:54:34.940 --> 00:54:36.800
Look at you!

00:54:37.610 --> 00:54:39.350
It was your fault in the first place...

00:54:40.070 --> 00:54:41.770
There you are!

00:54:41.860 --> 00:54:43.730
This is Maya's village.

00:54:43.820 --> 00:54:45.090
That's your name, Maya?

00:54:45.200 --> 00:54:47.270
Yes.
I'm Luffy!

00:54:47.370 --> 00:54:48.640
I'm Usopp!

00:54:48.740 --> 00:54:50.940
What have you guys been doing?!

00:54:51.040 --> 00:54:54.450
You wouldn't believe it.
We fell into this hole!

00:54:54.540 --> 00:54:56.490
It was a huge, long one.

00:54:57.500 --> 00:55:00.450
We've been running around
since yesterday trying to get out...

00:55:01.010 --> 00:55:02.410
You know what's been happening

00:55:02.510 --> 00:55:04.790
while you guys were playing around?!

00:55:05.260 --> 00:55:06.500
We weren't playing around!

00:55:06.840 --> 00:55:09.630
You wouldn't believe
what we've been through!

00:55:09.720 --> 00:55:11.170
Tell 'em, captain!

00:55:11.270 --> 00:55:13.260
Yeah!
Oh Lord...

00:55:19.020 --> 00:55:22.310
Luffy, you fought with Saga
at the marine corps dojo?

00:55:23.400 --> 00:55:24.440
I see.

00:55:24.530 --> 00:55:27.730
So Zoro went to see that guy
because of a promise they made...

00:55:28.120 --> 00:55:29.270
No doubt,

00:55:29.370 --> 00:55:32.860
that sword he had must have been
the Seven Star Sword.

00:55:32.950 --> 00:55:34.820
I'm sure of it. It was no ordinary sword.

00:55:34.910 --> 00:55:35.990
There was this...

00:55:36.080 --> 00:55:38.490
...eerie, weird light coming out of it.

00:55:38.670 --> 00:55:40.910
Totally spooky.

00:55:41.000 --> 00:55:44.500
But are you serious about
sacrificing your life?

00:55:45.260 --> 00:55:46.500
Hey!

00:55:46.800 --> 00:55:49.880
She's already made up her mind.

00:55:50.010 --> 00:55:52.170
Sanji, you can't be serious!

00:55:52.720 --> 00:55:54.210
I'll be right back.

00:55:54.930 --> 00:55:55.970
Luffy!

00:55:56.520 --> 00:55:58.640
We just have to get rid of that guy, right?

00:55:58.730 --> 00:55:59.800
- It's no use.
- What?

00:56:00.520 --> 00:56:02.600
Even if you beat Saga,

00:56:02.690 --> 00:56:06.270
you can't even scratch the Seven Star Sword.

00:56:06.360 --> 00:56:10.060
Using force is not the answer,
young lad in the straw hat.

00:56:10.620 --> 00:56:13.530
I'll just have to try and see.

00:56:13.620 --> 00:56:15.190
Luffy, one thing for sure.

00:56:15.290 --> 00:56:19.070
You're never gonna make it
to that marine corps dojo.

00:56:19.170 --> 00:56:21.620
You'll probably end up
falling in a hole again.

00:56:21.840 --> 00:56:23.410
- Hey...!
- It's all right...

00:56:23.550 --> 00:56:26.540
It's not all right!
Of course I'm afraid to die!

00:56:26.630 --> 00:56:29.080
But this is all my fault in the first place.

00:56:29.720 --> 00:56:32.880
Saga took the sword that day,

00:56:32.970 --> 00:56:35.300
because he wanted to protect me!

00:56:35.390 --> 00:56:36.660
If it weren't for me...

00:56:37.020 --> 00:56:38.260
If it weren't for me,

00:56:38.350 --> 00:56:40.760
He never would have fallen
under the curse of that sword!

00:56:41.310 --> 00:56:43.720
It's me who changed Saga! It's my fault!

00:56:43.820 --> 00:56:45.600
It's my fault...

00:56:47.900 --> 00:56:49.850
It was my fault...

00:56:55.490 --> 00:56:58.570
You're still in love with him...

00:57:02.080 --> 00:57:03.740
- Granny.
- What is it?

00:57:04.380 --> 00:57:05.570
I'm gonna do it.

00:57:05.670 --> 00:57:06.790
Maya...

00:57:06.880 --> 00:57:08.870
Now it's my turn to protect Saga.

00:57:08.970 --> 00:57:10.290
With my life!

00:57:11.140 --> 00:57:15.130
It's also for the people of this village
and this island I love so much!

00:57:17.730 --> 00:57:20.130
Thank you, Maya...!

00:57:20.230 --> 00:57:21.680
Granny...

00:57:23.150 --> 00:57:24.810
Miss Maya!

00:57:25.190 --> 00:57:26.680
Don't cry so much.

00:57:26.780 --> 00:57:27.850
<i>You mo.</i>

00:57:28.610 --> 00:57:30.730
You guys, cheer up!
I brought you a souvenir.

00:57:30.820 --> 00:57:31.940
A souvenir?

00:57:33.280 --> 00:57:34.660
Here. Aren't they pretty?

00:57:35.870 --> 00:57:37.140
Hm? What?
Those are...(spot)

00:57:39.460 --> 00:57:40.780
What?

00:57:40.870 --> 00:57:42.950
The gems they took from us!

00:57:43.210 --> 00:57:45.490
Where did you find them?

00:57:45.800 --> 00:57:48.660
I found them when we were
running around in the cave.

00:57:48.760 --> 00:57:51.120
Are they going to help us?

00:57:51.220 --> 00:57:52.830
They sure will!

00:57:54.260 --> 00:57:56.000
But why were they in the cave?

00:57:56.100 --> 00:57:57.500
What is this woman?

00:57:57.600 --> 00:57:58.630
You scared us.

00:57:58.890 --> 00:58:01.680
- Granny, we can do the ritual!
- Yes.

00:58:01.890 --> 00:58:02.930
Does that mean,

00:58:03.020 --> 00:58:05.220
Maya doesn't have to
sacrifice her life anymore!

00:58:05.360 --> 00:58:07.640
She doesn't have to die!

00:58:07.730 --> 00:58:10.600
But we still have to beware of Saga.

00:58:11.030 --> 00:58:15.480
If we go ahead with the ritual,
many people will get hurt.

00:58:15.620 --> 00:58:18.690
This is something that I have to do by
myself even if it means my life.

00:58:18.790 --> 00:58:20.650
You believe in Saga, don't you?

00:58:21.210 --> 00:58:23.200
Then believe in him to the end!

00:58:27.250 --> 00:58:29.580
Nobody can decide your fate for you.

00:58:29.670 --> 00:58:31.210
It's yours to decide.

00:58:31.590 --> 00:58:32.830
Yes.

00:58:32.930 --> 00:58:34.750
We're all behind you, Maya!

00:58:35.090 --> 00:58:37.850
That's right,
the Straw Hat Pirates!

00:58:37.930 --> 00:58:39.670
You can depend on us!

00:58:39.770 --> 00:58:41.260
Let's do it!

00:58:42.600 --> 00:58:44.800
Maya, we'll get you through this!

00:58:45.350 --> 00:58:46.800
Chopper!

00:58:46.900 --> 00:58:48.270
You GUYS"...

00:58:48.650 --> 00:58:50.520
Thank you!

00:58:50.610 --> 00:58:51.800
Of course!

00:58:51.900 --> 00:58:53.140
Thank you, Luffy!

00:58:53.240 --> 00:58:56.310
Sure! So what are we supposed to do?

00:58:57.660 --> 00:59:00.360
First, we have to get these gems
to the 3 towers...

00:59:00.450 --> 00:59:01.490
Namely,

00:59:01.580 --> 00:59:02.610
“Komon“

00:59:02.710 --> 00:59:03.740
<i>“Tomo“</i>

00:59:03.830 --> 00:59:05.100
“Hagun“

00:59:06.000 --> 00:59:07.870
We must create a shield

00:59:07.960 --> 00:59:09.660
to block the power of the Red Moon

00:59:09.840 --> 00:59:12.660
and prevent the resurrection of the sword.

00:59:12.760 --> 00:59:15.870
Luffy and I saw those towers.

00:59:15.970 --> 00:59:17.040
What?

00:59:17.140 --> 00:59:18.250
Oh, those?!

00:59:18.720 --> 00:59:21.550
- We can get there through that hole.
- Huh?

00:59:22.310 --> 00:59:24.300
What did you say?!

00:59:24.390 --> 00:59:26.340
That's funny!

00:59:26.440 --> 00:59:27.550
Don't do that anymore!

00:59:27.730 --> 00:59:28.890
Only on cue.

00:59:31.480 --> 00:59:33.600
This is a manmade hole.

00:59:34.400 --> 00:59:37.070
It was dug a long time ago.

00:59:37.780 --> 00:59:39.520
It must be a secret passage.

00:59:40.330 --> 00:59:42.480
Good work, Long Nose.

00:59:42.580 --> 00:59:44.320
I thought you were gonna stretch again!

00:59:44.410 --> 00:59:46.610
And don't call me “Long Nose“!

00:59:47.080 --> 00:59:52.950
We weren't running around in there
all night for nothing, Luffy!

00:59:53.050 --> 00:59:54.420
Isn't that great?!

00:59:54.510 --> 00:59:57.330
Yeah! We're geniuses!

00:59:57.430 --> 00:59:58.540
Yeah!

00:59:58.640 --> 00:59:59.750
We're such geniuses!

00:59:59.850 --> 01:00:00.960
The happy-go-lucky two.

01:00:01.060 --> 01:00:03.170
They were just lost.

01:00:03.270 --> 01:00:04.800
You guys ARE geniuses!

01:00:05.060 --> 01:00:06.470
Idiots...

01:00:07.900 --> 01:00:09.470
- Maya...
- Yes?

01:00:09.560 --> 01:00:11.560
It's almost sunset.

01:00:11.650 --> 01:00:13.560
Hurry and get ready!

01:00:21.580 --> 01:00:23.650
- Wow...
- Beautiful!

01:00:23.990 --> 01:00:25.530
Excellent!

01:00:25.790 --> 01:00:27.280
So pretty!

01:00:29.670 --> 01:00:31.700
The Gods of the Seven Stars of Aska...

01:00:31.790 --> 01:00:32.830
Our ancestors.

01:00:32.920 --> 01:00:34.620
The power of prayer...

01:00:37.970 --> 01:00:39.460
Komon

01:00:39.550 --> 01:00:41.040
Tonro

01:00:41.220 --> 01:00:42.840
Hagun

01:00:43.720 --> 01:00:46.550
Give me strength...

01:00:49.190 --> 01:00:50.340
Saga...

01:00:55.480 --> 01:00:57.310
Well done, Maya.

01:00:58.280 --> 01:00:59.690
Take them to the towers!

01:00:59.820 --> 01:01:00.980
You got it!

01:01:01.070 --> 01:01:03.270
We'll divide up into groups.

01:01:03.370 --> 01:01:04.400
Yeah!

01:01:07.710 --> 01:01:09.910
- Let's go, big man.
- Yes!

01:01:10.420 --> 01:01:11.870
- Robin!
- Okay.

01:01:12.710 --> 01:01:14.620
- chopper!
- Let's go!

01:01:14.920 --> 01:01:17.490
Granny, just tell me what to do!

01:01:17.760 --> 01:01:18.830
Good.

01:01:18.920 --> 01:01:20.710
Your job is the most important.

01:01:20.800 --> 01:01:21.880
Yes.

01:01:21.970 --> 01:01:24.880
I wonder if Zoro's still with Saga.

01:01:24.970 --> 01:01:30.430
We have to get rid of that Seven Star Sword
before it puts a curse on Zoro too.

01:01:30.520 --> 01:01:31.550
Yeah.

01:01:31.650 --> 01:01:33.430
I hope Zoro's okay.

01:01:33.520 --> 01:01:34.710
Don't worry about it.

01:01:35.980 --> 01:01:37.770
Zoro will come back.

01:01:37.860 --> 01:01:39.980
- Yeah!
- You're right.

01:01:40.400 --> 01:01:42.600
He's not gonna fall under any curse.

01:01:43.410 --> 01:01:45.570
No. He's too dense.

01:01:46.370 --> 01:01:47.530
But you're more so.

01:01:48.750 --> 01:01:51.990
Get the gems to the tower
no matter what it takes!

01:01:52.210 --> 01:01:55.330
Do it before the Red Moon reaches its peak!

01:01:55.540 --> 01:01:56.870
Yeah!

01:02:06.760 --> 01:02:08.590
Why is it so quiet?

01:02:41.170 --> 01:02:43.080
What was that?!

01:02:46.100 --> 01:02:48.920
Do you want to know what
Master's “dream“ really is?

01:02:49.020 --> 01:02:51.920
Mr Zoro...

01:02:52.020 --> 01:02:53.290
I'll ask him myself.

01:02:54.020 --> 01:02:56.220
You shouldn't underestimate

01:02:56.310 --> 01:02:58.100
the power of the Seven Star Sword.

01:02:59.480 --> 01:03:03.730
Tonight, that sword is going to
awaken from along sleep.

01:03:03.820 --> 01:03:08.190
And it needs the blood of
a strong man as its first prey.

01:03:08.280 --> 01:03:10.650
In other words, a sacrifice.

01:03:10.750 --> 01:03:12.400
And that would be me.

01:03:12.540 --> 01:03:15.740
Yes. And you did what needed to be done.

01:03:16.080 --> 01:03:17.740
And now I'm gonna be sacrificed.

01:03:18.630 --> 01:03:21.660
I thought Mr Luffy would be good for it,

01:03:21.760 --> 01:03:23.250
but I was a little disappointed in him.

01:03:24.260 --> 01:03:26.670
He's a kind of guy that
always exceeds your expectation.

01:03:26.760 --> 01:03:29.630
If you wanna become a real swordsman,
you'll have to learn how to read people.

01:03:32.060 --> 01:03:34.170
So what are you going to do, Mr Zoro?

01:03:34.850 --> 01:03:37.390
I put my life in his hands.

01:03:37.860 --> 01:03:39.350
That's all.

01:03:39.690 --> 01:03:41.220
I see.

01:03:41.320 --> 01:03:45.180
What kind of person is he really, our Master?

01:03:45.860 --> 01:03:49.980
He's the man you believe in... A swordsman.

01:03:53.580 --> 01:03:54.850
Wait.

01:03:55.620 --> 01:03:57.280
Unlike the others,

01:03:57.380 --> 01:04:01.160
I haven't completely lost my own “will.“

01:04:01.250 --> 01:04:02.410
But...

01:04:02.510 --> 01:04:04.910
That'll soon be gone too.

01:04:06.680 --> 01:04:08.380
It's what I wanted,

01:04:08.470 --> 01:04:10.130
but I'm still kind of sad.

01:04:12.350 --> 01:04:14.630
I'll no longer be me.

01:04:15.140 --> 01:04:16.630
So before that happens...

01:04:17.520 --> 01:04:20.300
Mr Zoro, will you do me a favor?

01:04:21.400 --> 01:04:22.640
Anytime.

01:04:27.910 --> 01:04:30.310
Even if I die fighting you,

01:04:30.410 --> 01:04:31.730
I won't regret it!

01:04:33.240 --> 01:04:35.780
I became Master's apprentice and
did get stronger!

01:04:35.870 --> 01:04:37.140
But this is not my own strength!

01:04:37.670 --> 01:04:39.660
I'm not fighting for justice
like how I've always dreamed!

01:04:39.750 --> 01:04:42.620
If I keep going like this,
I'm gonna die a plain murderer!

01:04:42.710 --> 01:04:44.240
I don't want that!

01:04:45.670 --> 01:04:48.120
Don't talk while you're fighting!

01:04:48.220 --> 01:04:49.880
Just think about winning!

01:04:55.430 --> 01:04:57.340
- Come on!
- Are you done?

01:04:59.600 --> 01:05:01.100
Not yet!

01:05:08.740 --> 01:05:09.850
Zoro!

01:05:09.950 --> 01:05:11.270
Zoro!

01:05:11.370 --> 01:05:12.740
Wait up!

01:05:12.830 --> 01:05:15.030
I promise I'll come find you!

01:05:15.120 --> 01:05:18.360
And I'm gonna become
much, much stronger.

01:05:19.040 --> 01:05:20.660
So Zoro!

01:05:20.750 --> 01:05:22.320
When you become the greatest swordsman,

01:05:23.040 --> 01:05:24.950
and when I master the sword of justice,

01:05:25.050 --> 01:05:27.250
we'll fight all the evil in this world!

01:05:27.340 --> 01:05:28.370
Saga...

01:05:31.260 --> 01:05:32.580
Not bad, Tohma.

01:05:33.550 --> 01:05:35.210
We're not finished yet!

01:05:41.980 --> 01:05:43.680
Having fun, Tohma?

01:05:43.770 --> 01:05:45.220
Master...

01:05:45.320 --> 01:05:47.270
Did you ask Zoro to play with you?

01:05:47.900 --> 01:05:49.020
Saga!

01:05:49.650 --> 01:05:51.100
Playtime is over.

01:06:03.880 --> 01:06:06.550
- Tohma!
- Get in our way, and Tohma dies!

01:06:08.380 --> 01:06:10.950
Tohma, get back to your position.

01:06:11.050 --> 01:06:12.080
Yes.

01:06:12.180 --> 01:06:13.790
As you wished,

01:06:13.890 --> 01:06:16.210
you will achieve the sword of justice.

01:06:16.310 --> 01:06:17.420
Sword of justice...

01:06:18.060 --> 01:06:19.670
Wait Tohma!
Don't go!

01:06:19.770 --> 01:06:22.050
The sword of justice is gonna be mine!

01:06:22.140 --> 01:06:23.640
Justice is power...!

01:06:23.730 --> 01:06:25.430
You're wrong!

01:06:26.360 --> 01:06:27.390
Tohma!

01:06:28.230 --> 01:06:29.420
Saga, you son of a bitch!

01:06:29.690 --> 01:06:31.810
Being strong means having power!

01:06:31.900 --> 01:06:32.940
That's justice.

01:06:33.030 --> 01:06:34.100
That's everything.

01:06:34.200 --> 01:06:37.730
I'm just trying to change the world into
what it really should be.

01:06:38.330 --> 01:06:41.240
Don't you realize
what you're doing to Tohma?

01:06:41.540 --> 01:06:45.240
You're making him do something that's
more painful than death itself!

01:06:45.790 --> 01:06:47.660
Tohma is too weak!

01:06:47.750 --> 01:06:49.450
His sword, his mind...

01:06:49.550 --> 01:06:50.920
That's why he needs my power...

01:06:51.010 --> 01:06:52.750
Weak?! You're wrong!

01:06:53.800 --> 01:06:58.000
He had a strong mind
and a pure dream like you before.

01:06:58.100 --> 01:07:02.260
That's why even the cursed sword
couldn't completely take over his mind!

01:07:02.980 --> 01:07:06.550
Tohma has a much stronger mind than you!

01:07:07.020 --> 01:07:08.260
Saga...

01:07:08.360 --> 01:07:10.430
You're not the Saga I used to know.

01:07:10.690 --> 01:07:11.850
That's right.

01:07:11.940 --> 01:07:13.940
I'm not the old me.

01:07:15.110 --> 01:07:17.310
And I'm about to be reborn again!

01:07:17.660 --> 01:07:19.730
That's why I called you here.

01:07:20.120 --> 01:07:22.440
In order to achieve my dream!

01:07:22.910 --> 01:07:24.990
Can't you go back to your old self?

01:07:25.170 --> 01:07:26.200
Saga!!

01:07:38.800 --> 01:07:41.340
Saga, you fool! Wake up!

01:07:47.650 --> 01:07:50.470
Don't let that cursed sword control you!

01:07:56.610 --> 01:07:57.860
Saga..

01:08:06.290 --> 01:08:08.860
I'm gonna break that cursed sword in two.

01:08:09.090 --> 01:08:10.870
“Tiger Hunt“!!

01:08:12.760 --> 01:08:13.910
It's no use.

01:08:15.050 --> 01:08:16.500
“Monster Sword“!!

01:08:19.010 --> 01:08:20.960
Didn't you hear me? It's no use.

01:08:21.260 --> 01:08:22.380
Then...

01:08:24.270 --> 01:08:27.930
Burn in the flames of mystic fire
and see for yourself!

01:08:28.350 --> 01:08:29.540
“Mystic Fire“...!!

01:08:38.450 --> 01:08:41.120
“Burning Monster Sword“!!!

01:08:45.000 --> 01:08:46.110
I don't believe it.

01:08:46.210 --> 01:08:47.580
It should have gotten him!

01:08:48.120 --> 01:08:51.030
Isn't it about time you realise, Zoro?

01:08:51.130 --> 01:08:55.750
Zoro, you don't have what it takes
to defeat my Seven Star Sword.

01:08:55.840 --> 01:08:57.030
Why...?!

01:08:57.680 --> 01:09:01.130
Why can't I break that measly cursed sword?!

01:09:01.890 --> 01:09:04.340
I won't kill you just yet, Zoro.

01:09:05.020 --> 01:09:09.180
Not until I let this Seven Star Sword
drink your blood!

01:09:09.690 --> 01:09:12.760
“Mystic Snake Fang attack“!!!

01:09:35.130 --> 01:09:37.750
A bad moon that looks like
it might drip blood...

01:09:42.140 --> 01:09:44.210
The marines...!

01:09:44.310 --> 01:09:46.260
I thought they'd be here!

01:09:54.860 --> 01:09:56.180
Not bad, Granny!

01:09:56.280 --> 01:09:57.720
Luffy! You...

01:09:58.240 --> 01:09:59.770
You ate the devil's fruit!?

01:09:59.860 --> 01:10:01.400
Yeah, I did!

01:10:07.950 --> 01:10:08.990
Oh, no...

01:10:09.080 --> 01:10:11.650
Straw Hat, we better retreat for now.

01:10:11.830 --> 01:10:13.660
Maya, follow me!

01:10:13.750 --> 01:10:14.870
Okay!

01:10:17.000 --> 01:10:19.160
That doesn't... WORK!

01:10:25.350 --> 01:10:27.250
- Gum-Gum
- Sickle!

01:10:27.350 --> 01:10:29.050
Hurry! Get Maya to the top of the castle!

01:10:29.140 --> 01:10:30.170
- Maya, let's go!
- Yes!

01:10:33.350 --> 01:10:34.430
Right here!

01:10:34.520 --> 01:10:36.010
We don't have to go to the top?

01:10:36.110 --> 01:10:37.220
No.

01:10:37.320 --> 01:10:40.560
Maya, start now! Concentrate!

01:10:40.650 --> 01:10:42.140
Yes!

01:10:42.240 --> 01:10:43.350
Good luck, Maya!

01:10:48.240 --> 01:10:51.360
The Red Moon will soon reach its peak...

01:10:52.160 --> 01:10:53.490
The legendary priestess...

01:10:53.580 --> 01:10:55.780
please protect her!

01:11:04.840 --> 01:11:08.210
The Gods of Aska dwelling
in the Seven Stars of Aska...

01:11:08.310 --> 01:11:10.010
Please give me strength.

01:11:10.100 --> 01:11:12.510
Give me strength and the power of prayer.

01:11:13.100 --> 01:11:14.760
With your divine love,

01:11:14.940 --> 01:11:19.060
please protect the island
and seas of Aska from evil.

01:11:19.150 --> 01:11:21.720
Purify the evil power,

01:11:21.820 --> 01:11:26.110
and expel the evil from Saga...

01:11:27.160 --> 01:11:28.940
The Gods of Aska!

01:11:29.410 --> 01:11:31.980
Please hear my prayer...

01:11:32.870 --> 01:11:35.280
Please help us...!

01:11:36.380 --> 01:11:37.650
Pray...

01:11:37.880 --> 01:11:39.660
Pray, Maya-

01:11:41.210 --> 01:11:44.080
I wonder if Nami and those guys
found the tower...

01:11:44.380 --> 01:11:46.870
Hey, you're here already.

01:11:47.600 --> 01:11:48.630
I was expecting you.

01:11:48.720 --> 01:11:50.550
You guys never give up, do you?!

01:11:50.640 --> 01:11:52.920
But it'll be all over soon!

01:11:53.730 --> 01:11:56.090
Come, stupid marines!

01:12:04.900 --> 01:12:06.180
This is an armour of steel!

01:12:06.280 --> 01:12:07.520
Nothing will penetrate it!

01:12:07.620 --> 01:12:08.860
Oh yeah?!

01:12:08.950 --> 01:12:09.730
Well then..

01:12:09.830 --> 01:12:11.730
How about your head and face?

01:12:12.200 --> 01:12:14.240
You forgot to cover them up!

01:12:14.620 --> 01:12:16.070
The gem!

01:12:16.290 --> 01:12:17.360
Okay!

01:12:24.380 --> 01:12:25.960
I was waiting for you!

01:12:27.970 --> 01:12:29.590
Come, ladies!

01:12:30.180 --> 01:12:31.450
You'll regret this, morons!

01:12:31.850 --> 01:12:35.840
I'm Usopp, the great warrior of the seas!

01:12:36.390 --> 01:12:37.930
Get 'em, Robin!

01:12:38.770 --> 01:12:39.850
“Faint Fleur“

01:12:45.950 --> 01:12:46.980
Stop!

01:12:52.200 --> 01:12:53.780
Well done, Robin!

01:12:53.870 --> 01:12:55.320
Come on, let's go!

01:12:55.500 --> 01:12:56.530
Fine.

01:12:59.130 --> 01:13:02.080
You guys can't touch this, can you?

01:13:02.170 --> 01:13:03.200
How about this?

01:13:07.720 --> 01:13:08.990
There you go!

01:13:15.350 --> 01:13:17.380
Because of something foolish I did...

01:13:17.480 --> 01:13:20.640
I lost the use of my right arm
and my future as a swordsman.

01:13:22.150 --> 01:13:25.850
But instead, I now have
this Seven Star Sword.

01:13:26.610 --> 01:13:30.810
And soon, the Red Moon
will rise to its peak.

01:13:30.910 --> 01:13:33.900
When that happens,
I will become one with the sword

01:13:33.990 --> 01:13:36.320
and succeed all its power!

01:13:36.830 --> 01:13:39.740
And the world I seek, of fighting and
hatred, will soon be real...

01:13:40.790 --> 01:13:42.030
There will be bloodshed,

01:13:42.130 --> 01:13:43.200
hatred, and death!

01:13:43.290 --> 01:13:46.500
A world of true darkness!

01:13:46.590 --> 01:13:48.960
And I will be its ruler!

01:13:51.970 --> 01:13:53.210
Saga...

01:13:54.060 --> 01:13:55.590
Our dream...

01:13:55.680 --> 01:13:58.720
The promise we made...

01:14:00.520 --> 01:14:02.680
- is nothing like that!!!
- You fool!

01:14:03.860 --> 01:14:05.100
“Demon Fire“!!

01:14:11.070 --> 01:14:12.560
<i>Zoro,</i>

01:14:12.660 --> 01:14:14.730
you cannot kill me.

01:14:16.290 --> 01:14:19.530
I knew this would happen
even before we started the fight.

01:14:20.370 --> 01:14:21.530
Now, get up!

01:14:21.620 --> 01:14:23.410
I want your blood!

01:14:24.000 --> 01:14:25.910
Blood of a strong fighter!

01:14:30.840 --> 01:14:32.250
What's that?!

01:14:32.340 --> 01:14:33.670
No way!

01:14:34.100 --> 01:14:35.130
Why?!

01:14:36.260 --> 01:14:37.590
There.

01:14:43.230 --> 01:14:44.640
Whoa.

01:14:44.730 --> 01:14:45.970
Wow.

01:14:53.110 --> 01:14:54.650
Look at that light!

01:14:54.870 --> 01:14:58.690
The light makes a shield to
prevent the powers of the sword!

01:15:11.970 --> 01:15:13.120
The moon!

01:15:13.220 --> 01:15:14.540
She's created a shield!

01:15:14.640 --> 01:15:16.880
Nami and the guys must have succeeded!

01:15:16.970 --> 01:15:18.000
Yes!

01:15:18.100 --> 01:15:20.010
The power of the Red Moon will dissipate

01:15:20.100 --> 01:15:23.380
as soon as it passes its peak.

01:15:23.640 --> 01:15:27.220
Let's hope Maya can
continue her prayers until then.

01:15:30.860 --> 01:15:32.130
What's going on?!

01:15:32.900 --> 01:15:34.850
The moon will soon reach its peak...

01:15:36.530 --> 01:15:38.110
Why the shield?

01:15:38.200 --> 01:15:40.320
I thought we got rid of the gems!

01:15:41.000 --> 01:15:43.150
It must be Maya!

01:15:55.380 --> 01:15:56.540
Saga...

01:16:00.640 --> 01:16:01.670
Maya!

01:16:01.770 --> 01:16:04.440
Concentrate! Keep your mind on the prayer!

01:16:10.480 --> 01:16:11.520
Luffy!

01:16:11.610 --> 01:16:13.680
Don't try to stop me, Maya!!!

01:16:16.110 --> 01:16:17.190
Maya!

01:16:17.950 --> 01:16:19.060
Damn! Ouch!

01:16:19.830 --> 01:16:20.860
Maya, you okay?!

01:16:20.950 --> 01:16:22.110
Maya!

01:16:26.210 --> 01:16:27.530
Wake up!

01:16:27.630 --> 01:16:29.000
Oh no!

01:16:29.090 --> 01:16:30.740
The shield is disappearing!

01:16:31.340 --> 01:16:32.580
It's almost there!

01:16:32.670 --> 01:16:33.910
Then l will...!

01:16:39.050 --> 01:16:40.330
Straw Hat...

01:16:40.640 --> 01:16:42.960
I thought you were dead a long time ago.

01:16:43.180 --> 01:16:45.420
I won't lose to YOU!

01:16:45.560 --> 01:16:46.830
Haven't you had enough?

01:16:48.690 --> 01:16:49.930
Gum-Gum

01:16:50.020 --> 01:16:51.560
Pistol!

01:16:57.150 --> 01:16:58.480
Gum-Gum

01:16:58.570 --> 01:17:00.150
Bazooka!

01:17:05.870 --> 01:17:06.900
Gum-Gum

01:17:07.000 --> 01:17:08.700
SPEAR!

01:17:10.580 --> 01:17:11.660
Gum-Gum

01:17:11.750 --> 01:17:13.290
Axe!

01:17:16.510 --> 01:17:17.660
“Demon Fire“!!!

01:17:18.090 --> 01:17:19.360
Gum-Gum

01:17:19.510 --> 01:17:20.670
What?!

01:17:20.760 --> 01:17:22.880
Windmill!

01:17:26.270 --> 01:17:27.590
Gum-Gum

01:17:27.730 --> 01:17:29.130
Hammer!!

01:17:31.860 --> 01:17:34.100
Sacrifice yourself to the Seven Star Sword!

01:17:34.650 --> 01:17:36.060
You can go right after Zoro,

01:17:36.150 --> 01:17:37.310
Straw Hat!

01:17:37.740 --> 01:17:38.850
Sacrifice?

01:17:38.950 --> 01:17:40.770
He's not gonna die!

01:17:40.870 --> 01:17:45.150
He's gonna become
the world's greatest swordsman!

01:17:46.450 --> 01:17:47.400
All right!

01:17:51.170 --> 01:17:53.840
I underestimated you.

01:17:53.920 --> 01:17:54.990
But...

01:17:57.920 --> 01:17:58.960
At last...

01:17:59.760 --> 01:18:01.250
At last the time has come!

01:18:07.520 --> 01:18:08.710
The Seven Star Sword!

01:18:08.810 --> 01:18:10.000
Saga, NO!

01:18:10.100 --> 01:18:11.840
STOP!

01:18:13.400 --> 01:18:14.890
I can feel the power!

01:18:15.070 --> 01:18:18.310
Nobody can stop me!!!

01:18:23.660 --> 01:18:24.820
What's happening?!

01:18:34.040 --> 01:18:35.990
My right arm!

01:18:41.430 --> 01:18:42.460
Saga!!

01:18:57.070 --> 01:19:00.180
SAGA!

01:19:14.670 --> 01:19:16.070
What's going on?

01:19:16.340 --> 01:19:17.370
Earthquake?!

01:19:17.460 --> 01:19:18.730
The moon's red!

01:19:18.840 --> 01:19:21.040
When the Red Moon fills the sky,

01:19:21.130 --> 01:19:24.120
its power is bestowed upon the sword.

01:19:24.470 --> 01:19:25.850
We were too late...

01:19:26.470 --> 01:19:29.630
The Seven Star Sword
broke the shield and possessed Saga!

01:19:30.100 --> 01:19:32.660
The Seven Stars are defeated, and now

01:19:32.770 --> 01:19:35.590
the beginning of the world of darkness!

01:19:36.150 --> 01:19:38.350
The Seven Stars are defeated!

01:19:38.730 --> 01:19:39.850
Hey you!

01:19:39.940 --> 01:19:42.140
Stop talking crap!

01:19:43.950 --> 01:19:45.100
Straw Hat,

01:19:45.200 --> 01:19:47.980
let me show you the true power
of the Seven Star Sword!!

01:19:58.670 --> 01:19:59.740
Look out!

01:20:03.970 --> 01:20:05.210
Saga...

01:20:05.300 --> 01:20:06.490
Wake up!

01:20:10.890 --> 01:20:12.380
This is my true power!

01:20:12.480 --> 01:20:14.010
How'd you like that, Straw Hat?!

01:20:15.730 --> 01:20:17.050
You little pest!

01:20:17.400 --> 01:20:18.770
You ready?!

01:20:24.280 --> 01:20:25.730
Gum-Gum

01:20:25.820 --> 01:20:27.090
Pistol!

01:20:34.250 --> 01:20:35.320
Luffy!

01:20:35.410 --> 01:20:37.410
Are we finished?

01:20:37.630 --> 01:20:39.280
- Maya?!
- I'm not giving up.

01:20:40.630 --> 01:20:42.080
I will pray...

01:20:42.840 --> 01:20:44.220
Until the end!

01:20:45.840 --> 01:20:46.870
We're not done yet!

01:20:48.300 --> 01:20:49.330
Gum-Gum

01:20:49.430 --> 01:20:50.460
Stomp!

01:20:55.640 --> 01:20:56.830
The light disappeared!

01:20:57.190 --> 01:20:58.760
- Something must have happened to Maya!
- What?!

01:21:00.020 --> 01:21:01.050
What's going on?!

01:21:03.570 --> 01:21:04.600
Nami!

01:21:04.690 --> 01:21:05.730
“Rumble“!!!

01:21:05.820 --> 01:21:07.440
Get out of here!

01:21:08.660 --> 01:21:09.850
Now do you see?!

01:21:10.370 --> 01:21:11.770
You can't even scratch me

01:21:11.870 --> 01:21:15.440
with your Devil Fruit power!

01:21:17.710 --> 01:21:19.870
I'm gonna give you more than a scratch!

01:21:20.380 --> 01:21:23.160
'Coz if I don't, all that Maya
and my friends are doing

01:21:23.250 --> 01:21:24.660
go to waste!

01:21:24.880 --> 01:21:27.250
You don't think you can beat
my sword, the strongest...

01:21:27.340 --> 01:21:29.540
You really Zoro's friend?

01:21:29.640 --> 01:21:30.710
What?

01:21:30.800 --> 01:21:33.130
Then you should be strong

01:21:33.220 --> 01:21:34.410
even without using that weird sword.

01:21:36.020 --> 01:21:38.630
If that's the greatest sword,

01:21:38.730 --> 01:21:41.430
then I'm the greatest, of the greatest,
of the greatest, of the greatest...

01:21:43.570 --> 01:21:45.680
of the greatest

01:21:45.860 --> 01:21:47.730
PIRATE KING!

01:21:48.110 --> 01:21:49.380
Gum-Gum

01:21:49.490 --> 01:21:51.190
Gatling!!!

01:21:58.250 --> 01:22:01.160
I'm...
I'm...

01:22:04.460 --> 01:22:05.650
Saga...

01:22:05.760 --> 01:22:06.830
I---

01:22:11.050 --> 01:22:12.630
Saga...

01:22:12.720 --> 01:22:13.750
I---

01:22:20.440 --> 01:22:22.140
The Gods of the Seven Stars of Aska...

01:22:22.560 --> 01:22:23.640
Give me strength...

01:22:24.150 --> 01:22:25.930
The light is back!
It's Luffy!

01:22:26.030 --> 01:22:27.430
He's doing it!

01:22:27.530 --> 01:22:28.560
Miss Maya!

01:22:28.650 --> 01:22:31.130
Don't worry!
She has Luffy with her!

01:22:33.370 --> 01:22:34.480
Bastard!

01:22:34.580 --> 01:22:35.950
“HORN POINT“!

01:22:47.510 --> 01:22:50.070
- Why?!
- My power is weakening...

01:22:50.170 --> 01:22:52.000
Maya's using the powers of the moon...

01:22:52.180 --> 01:22:53.210
Gum-Gum

01:22:53.300 --> 01:22:54.540
Bazooka!

01:22:55.760 --> 01:22:57.380
Gum-Gum

01:22:57.470 --> 01:22:58.880
Spear!

01:23:11.320 --> 01:23:13.310
The Seven Star Sword shattered!

01:23:13.410 --> 01:23:14.440
Saga..

01:23:22.750 --> 01:23:23.940
All right!!

01:23:27.550 --> 01:23:29.120
Is it over?

01:23:30.170 --> 01:23:32.410
Did we stop the resurrection of the sword?

01:23:32.510 --> 01:23:33.580
Did we...?!

01:23:46.360 --> 01:23:47.540
What is it!?

01:23:47.650 --> 01:23:50.350
The power of the Seven Star Sword

01:23:50.440 --> 01:23:52.980
possessed Saga!

01:23:53.450 --> 01:23:54.690
Whaaat?!

01:24:10.800 --> 01:24:11.830
Oh my God...

01:24:11.920 --> 01:24:13.370
The shield is gone!

01:24:13.470 --> 01:24:15.950
Is this its true form?

01:24:16.050 --> 01:24:18.920
The sword has completely possessed Saga!

01:24:19.010 --> 01:24:21.460
The shield is meaningless now!

01:24:22.730 --> 01:24:23.910
Maya!!

01:24:31.480 --> 01:24:33.180
What's going on?

01:24:34.110 --> 01:24:35.140
Maya...

01:24:37.200 --> 01:24:38.470
GUARD POINT!

01:24:39.160 --> 01:24:40.320
THUNDER TEMPO!

01:24:43.450 --> 01:24:45.200
KOKUTEI ROSEO!

01:24:48.130 --> 01:24:49.450
All right!!

01:24:56.930 --> 01:24:57.960
Saga!!

01:24:58.640 --> 01:25:00.790
I believe in you.

01:25:00.890 --> 01:25:02.380
No matter what happens...

01:25:02.470 --> 01:25:05.800
I will keep praying

01:25:05.890 --> 01:25:08.260
until you return to your normal self.

01:25:10.520 --> 01:25:12.010
<i>Stop“!</i>

01:25:18.110 --> 01:25:19.150
Maya!

01:25:19.240 --> 01:25:20.270
Luffy...!

01:25:21.910 --> 01:25:23.730
We're not finished yet.

01:25:23.990 --> 01:25:26.320
- You ready?!
- Luffy, wait!

01:25:27.080 --> 01:25:28.820
Zoro! What took you so long?!

01:25:29.380 --> 01:25:31.120
Let ME...

01:25:31.960 --> 01:25:34.040
...do this.

01:25:39.010 --> 01:25:40.580
You stay out of it!

01:25:41.890 --> 01:25:43.590
As your captain,

01:25:43.680 --> 01:25:44.800
I'll watch you do it!

01:25:49.650 --> 01:25:50.970
Saga...

01:25:51.060 --> 01:25:52.930
You are a swordsman.

01:25:53.020 --> 01:25:54.210
So take your sword!!

01:25:58.110 --> 01:26:00.400
I made you a promise...

01:26:00.490 --> 01:26:03.270
I told you I'd be back to save you!

01:26:38.030 --> 01:26:39.100
The gem!

01:27:04.800 --> 01:27:06.960
I can hear you..

01:27:07.060 --> 01:27:09.090
I can hear your voice...

01:27:09.680 --> 01:27:12.510
Screaming for help...

01:27:12.600 --> 01:27:14.720
You must know why you called him here...

01:27:14.810 --> 01:27:15.970
You must...

01:27:16.070 --> 01:27:19.180
You must know best!

01:27:19.280 --> 01:27:20.310
Saga!

01:27:22.660 --> 01:27:23.840
The Aska Seven Stars!

01:27:46.930 --> 01:27:48.120
Zoro!!

01:27:48.220 --> 01:27:51.090
You're going to become
the world's greatest swordsman!!

01:27:51.390 --> 01:27:53.050
That's why there's nothing
your sword can't slay!

01:27:53.230 --> 01:27:55.590
Get that moon!!!

01:28:01.610 --> 01:28:03.600
My sword is going through you, my friend!

01:28:05.360 --> 01:28:06.520
Saga!

01:28:06.620 --> 01:28:09.440
Because I believe in you!

01:28:57.710 --> 01:28:58.870
Zoro!!

01:29:04.880 --> 01:29:06.830
I'm hungry--

01:29:23.280 --> 01:29:25.730
It was the human mind

01:29:25.820 --> 01:29:27.230
that turned the Seven Star Sword evil.

01:29:27.910 --> 01:29:33.530
Once upon a time, there was
a cursed sword in our country...

01:29:33.620 --> 01:29:34.650
But...

01:29:34.750 --> 01:29:38.820
the same human mind can get rid of the evil.

01:29:40.420 --> 01:29:42.120
I want to believe...

01:29:42.550 --> 01:29:44.660
No. I DO believe...

01:29:46.920 --> 01:29:50.750
that if there's darkness inside us,

01:29:50.970 --> 01:29:54.710
there is also light that
shines upon the darkness.

01:30:06.490 --> 01:30:09.770
Well, those guys were one hell of a group.

01:30:10.450 --> 01:30:13.230
Too bad you're pirates though.

01:30:13.330 --> 01:30:14.780
Give them a break, Granny!

01:30:15.040 --> 01:30:16.360
It's true!

01:30:16.660 --> 01:30:19.700
I promise you that
I'll master the sword of justice.

01:30:20.960 --> 01:30:23.630
The only atonement for what I did.

01:30:38.020 --> 01:30:39.050
Zoro.

01:30:44.900 --> 01:30:47.350
I give you my word, Zoro.

01:30:51.200 --> 01:30:53.060
Sanji, there's not enough food!

01:30:53.200 --> 01:30:54.820
I need more!

01:30:54.910 --> 01:30:57.030
There's more than enough food!

01:30:57.120 --> 01:30:59.240
Maya gave us tons!

01:30:59.330 --> 01:31:00.360
Look!

01:31:04.090 --> 01:31:06.620
- Delicious! Yummy!
- A feast! A feast!

01:31:06.710 --> 01:31:07.830
Zoro.

01:31:07.920 --> 01:31:10.250
Come over and eat.

01:31:10.340 --> 01:31:12.460
Yeah, Zoro! Let's eat!

01:31:14.430 --> 01:31:17.180
You better hurry,
or there'll be nothing left!

01:31:17.970 --> 01:31:19.050
Luffy!

01:31:19.140 --> 01:31:22.800
He probably feels bad
about this whole thing.

01:31:22.900 --> 01:31:24.140
The jerk,

01:31:24.270 --> 01:31:25.350
he wanted to fight me.

01:31:25.860 --> 01:31:28.560
Hey, forget about it.

01:31:28.650 --> 01:31:29.890
It's over. Come on, eat, Zoro.

01:31:30.440 --> 01:31:32.730
Leave me alone.

01:31:34.910 --> 01:31:36.150
What's that?! The marines?!

01:31:39.250 --> 01:31:40.990
A huge hippo!

01:31:41.080 --> 01:31:43.200
No, it's a hippo rhino!

01:31:43.370 --> 01:31:44.560
A hippo rhino?!

01:31:44.670 --> 01:31:46.950
He says... “Going Merry saved my life...

01:31:47.090 --> 01:31:51.290
- ...and now I'm in love with you“!

01:31:51.810 --> 01:31:53.810
- Whaaat?!

01:31:54.550 --> 01:31:56.380
When did we ever save his life?

01:31:56.470 --> 01:31:59.960
And why the hell is he attacking us?

01:32:00.060 --> 01:32:02.170
It's sort of a mating call.

01:32:03.100 --> 01:32:05.580
In away, he's proposing to us.

01:32:05.690 --> 01:32:08.250
Proposing?!

01:32:10.820 --> 01:32:13.190
- This is a proposal?!
- He'll sink us!

01:32:13.280 --> 01:32:15.950
What were you guys doing while I was gone?

01:32:19.330 --> 01:32:21.890
Come on!
To our next adventure!

01:32:22.000 --> 01:32:24.030
Forward at full speed!!

01:32:25.290 --> 01:32:28.490
This is worse than the marines!

01:32:28.590 --> 01:32:33.580
<i>Nakushita yume wa sa, dare no sei..?</i>

01:32:28.590 --> 01:32:33.580
<i>Who let me lose my dream?</i>

01:32:34.720 --> 01:32:39.710
<i>Tameiki wo tsuite miushinau</i>

01:32:34.720 --> 01:32:39.710
<i>I lost track of it as I let out a sigh</i>

01:32:40.680 --> 01:32:45.680
<i>Sukoshi dake hayaku hashiridash</i>

01:32:40.680 --> 01:32:45.680
<i>As I start running a little faster</i>

01:32:46.690 --> 01:32:52.520
<i>Sora wa kimi to boku wo matteiru</i>

01:32:46.690 --> 01:32:52.520
<i>The sky awaits us</i>

01:32:52.820 --> 01:32:55.190
<i>Mado wo akete sa</i>

01:32:52.820 --> 01:32:55.190
<i>Open the windows</i>

01:32:55.780 --> 01:32:58.810
<i>Todokanai kumo mo</i>

01:32:55.780 --> 01:32:58.810
<i>And we can reach the clouds</i>

01:32:58.910 --> 01:33:07.820
<i>Kitto itsuka wa tadoritsukeru</i>

01:32:58.910 --> 01:33:07.820
<i>That I thought I'd never reach</i>

01:33:07.920 --> 01:33:13.070
<i>Itsuka wa…</i>

01:33:07.920 --> 01:33:13.070
<i>Some day...</i>

01:33:13.550 --> 01:33:16.080
<i>Donna ni tsuyoku nigitte mo</i>

01:33:13.550 --> 01:33:16.080
<i>No matter how hard I hold on</i>

01:33:16.180 --> 01:33:18.840
<i>Hitori ja koboreochisou de</i>

01:33:16.180 --> 01:33:18.840
<i>On my own, Heel like they slip away</i>

01:33:18.930 --> 01:33:21.750
<i>Shinjite miyou tte itta</i>

01:33:18.930 --> 01:33:21.750
<i>You told me to believe</i>

01:33:21.850 --> 01:33:26.300
<i>Motto waratte you</i>

01:33:21.850 --> 01:33:26.300
<i>So I'll keep smiling</i>

01:33:32.440 --> 01:33:36.730
<i>Kotoba ni dekinai omoi darake de</i>

01:33:32.440 --> 01:33:36.730
<i>No words can describe how I feel</i>

01:33:37.990 --> 01:33:39.980
<i>Nigete shimaeba</i>

01:33:37.990 --> 01:33:39.980
<i>wonder what happens</i>

01:33:40.070 --> 01:33:42.400
<i>dou ni ka naru ka na? </i>

01:33:40.070 --> 01:33:42.400
<i>If I simply run away?</i>

01:33:43.410 --> 01:33:47.910
<i>Omoigakenai tsuyoi kaze ni</i>

01:33:43.410 --> 01:33:47.910
<i>The wind blows harder than I thought</i>

01:33:48.330 --> 01:33:50.870
<i>Demo ashita wa kitto</i>

01:33:48.330 --> 01:33:50.870
<i>But tomorrow, I believe</i>

01:33:51.210 --> 01:33:53.160
<i>Tobitateru ne</i>

01:33:51.210 --> 01:33:53.160
<i>I'd be able to fly</i>

01:33:53.250 --> 01:33:56.250
<i>Chizu wa nakute mo</i>

01:33:53.250 --> 01:33:56.250
<i>Even without a map</i>

01:33:56.590 --> 01:33:59.120
<i>Donna ni tsuyoku nigitte mo</i>

01:33:56.590 --> 01:33:59.120
<i>No matter how hard I hold on</i>

01:33:59.220 --> 01:34:01.630
<i>Hitori ja koboreochisou de</i>

01:33:59.220 --> 01:34:01.630
<i>On my own, Heel like they slip away</i>

01:34:01.720 --> 01:34:04.470
<i>Shinjite miyou tte itta</i>

01:34:01.720 --> 01:34:04.470
<i>You told me to believe</i>

01:34:04.600 --> 01:34:07.010
<i>Motto waratte you</i>

01:34:04.600 --> 01:34:07.010
<i>So I'll keep smiling</i>

01:34:07.440 --> 01:34:10.260
<i>Mada mienai ano basho e</i>

01:34:07.440 --> 01:34:10.260
<i>A place I'm yet to reach</i>

01:34:10.350 --> 01:34:13.060
<i>Bokura egaku ano basho e</i>

01:34:10.350 --> 01:34:13.060
<i>The place I dream of</i>

01:34:13.220 --> 01:34:15.770
<i>Kawaranai omoi motte</i>

01:34:13.220 --> 01:34:15.770
<i>With never-changing emotions</i>

01:34:15.860 --> 01:34:22.470
<i>Ano mukou e to hashiridasou</i>

01:34:15.860 --> 01:34:22.470
<i>Let's take a journey to that time</i>

01:34:22.750 --> 01:34:25.520
<i>Donna ni hayaku hashitte mo</i>

01:34:22.750 --> 01:34:25.520
<i>No matter how fast I run</i>

01:34:25.520 --> 01:34:28.280
<i>Ii koto bakari janai yo ne</i>

01:34:25.520 --> 01:34:28.280
<i>It's not always good times</i>

01:34:28.410 --> 01:34:30.950
<i>Bokura no koe kasanete sa</i>

01:34:28.410 --> 01:34:30.950
<i>Let's sing along</i>

01:34:31.080 --> 01:34:33.620
<i>Motto waratte you</i>

01:34:31.080 --> 01:34:33.620
<i>And laugh together</i>

01:34:33.850 --> 01:34:36.530
<i>Ima shikanai ano basho e</i>

01:34:33.850 --> 01:34:36.530
<i>The place we can only reach now</i>

01:34:36.630 --> 01:34:39.330
<i>Bokura mezasu ano basho e</i>

01:34:36.630 --> 01:34:39.330
<i>The place we long for</i>

01:34:39.430 --> 01:34:42.130
<i>Kazaranai omoi motte</i>

01:34:39.430 --> 01:34:42.130
<i>With emotions so true and honest</i>

01:34:42.260 --> 01:34:49.740
<i>Ano mukou e to hashiridasou</i>

